<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mateo Asɛmpa No</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mateo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Asɛmpa No</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kristo Mpanimfoɔ</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Yesu Kristo a ɔfiri Ɔhene Dawid ne Abraham abusua mu no mpanimfoɔ din na ɛdidi soɔ yi:<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abraham ba ne Isak,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">Isak ba ne Yakob;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yakob nso mma ne Yuda ne ne nuanom.<verse eid="MAT 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuda mma ne Peres ne Sera. Wɔn maame ne Tamar.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Peres ba ne Hesron</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">ɛnna Hesron nso ba ne Ram.<verse eid="MAT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Ram woo Aminadab;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadab woo Nahson;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Nahson nso woo Salmon.<verse eid="MAT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmon ne ne yere Rahab woo Boas;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Boas ne ne yere Rut woo Obed;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obed nso woo Yisai.<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yisai ba ne Ɔhene Dawid.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawid ba ne Salomo. Dawid ne Batseba a na anka ɔyɛ Uria yere no na wɔwoo Salomo.<verse eid="MAT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Salomo woo Rehoboam;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehoboam woo Abia;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abia woo Asa.<verse eid="MAT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asa woo Yehosafat;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehosafat woo Yoram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yoram nso woo Usia<verse eid="MAT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Usia ba ne Yotam;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotam ba ne Ahas:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahas ba ne Hiskia.<verse eid="MAT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hiskia ba ne Manase,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase ba ne Amon;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon nso ba ne Yosia.<verse eid="MAT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosia woo Yekonia ne ne nuanom. Wɔwoo wɔn ɛberɛ a na Yudafoɔ te nnommum mu wɔ Babilon no.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Wɔn a wɔfiri Babilon nnommum mu baeɛ no akyi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nie:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Yekonia woo Sealtiel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Sealtiel woo Serubabel.<verse eid="MAT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Serubabel woo Abihud;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihud woo Eliakim;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliakim nso woo Asor.<verse eid="MAT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Asor ba ne Sadok;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadok ba ne Akim;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim ba ne Elihud.<verse eid="MAT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Elihud ba ne Eleasa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleasa ba ne Matan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Matan nso ba ne Yakob;<verse eid="MAT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakob woo Yosef a ɔwaree Maria no. Saa Maria yi na ɔwoo Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ a ɛfiri Abraham so de bɛsi Ɔhene Dawid so yɛ dunan. Ɛfiri Ɔhene Dawid so de bɛsi ɛberɛ a wɔfaa ɔman no nnommum kɔɔ Babilon no nso awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ yɛ dunan saa ara. Saa ara nso na ɛfiri ɛberɛ a wɔtu firii Babilon sane baa wɔn ɔman mu bio no de bɛsi Kristo awoɔ so nso yɛ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ dunan.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Sɛdeɛ Yesu Kristo awoɔ ho nsɛm teɛ nie: Wɔde ne maame Maria maa Yosef sɛ ɔnware no, nanso ansa na wɔbɛhyiam sɛ awarefoɔ no, ɔhunuu sɛ wanyinsɛn deɛ ɛfiri Honhom Kronkron. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Ɛbaa saa no, ne kunu Yosef a ɔdi ne ho ni no ampɛ sɛ ɔbɛgu Maria anim ase enti, ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛgyaa no awadeɛ kɔkoam.<verse eid="MAT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Ɛberɛ a asɛm no ayɛ Yosef dadwene no, Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ bɛyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ no daeɛ mu. Ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yosef, Dawid aseni, nnyae Maria awadeɛ ɛfiri sɛ, ne nyinsɛn no firi Honhom Kronkron. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Ɔbɛwo ɔbarima na wɔato no edin Yesu, aseɛ ne Agyenkwa, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno na ɔbɛgye ne nkurɔfoɔ nkwa afiri wɔn bɔne mu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Yei nyinaa baa mu de hyɛɛ deɛ Awurade nam odiyifoɔ no so kaeɛ no ma sɛ: <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Ɔbaabunu no bɛnyinsɛn, na wawo ɔbabarima, na wɔato no edin Immanuel” a aseɛ ne sɛ, “Onyankopɔn ne yɛn wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Ɛberɛ a Yosef nyaneeɛ no, ɔyɛɛ sɛdeɛ ɔbɔfoɔ no hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. Enti ɔkɔfaa Maria baa ne fie ma ɔbɛyɛɛ ne yere. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Yosef ne Maria anhyia da kɔsii sɛ Maria woo ɔbabarima maa Yosef too ne din “Yesu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Anyansafoɔ A Wɔfiri Apueeɛ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Ɔhene Herode di adeɛ no na wɔwoo Yesu wɔ Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yudea. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu na anyansafoɔ bi firi apueeɛ baa Yerusalem bɛbisaa sɛ, “Ɛhe na Yudafoɔ ɔhene a wɔawo no no wɔ? Yɛhunuu ne nsoromma wɔ apueeɛ nohoa enti na yɛaba sɛ yɛrebɛsom no.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Ɔhene Herode tee saa asɛm yi no, ɛhaa nʼadwene yie. Saa ara nso na ɛhaa Yerusalemfoɔ nyinaa adwene. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Ɔhene Herode frɛɛ ɔman no mu asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ bɛhyiaeɛ. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛhefa na wɔbɛwo Kristo no?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yudea. Na yei ne deɛ odiyifoɔ no kaeɛ:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“ ‘Ao kuro Betlehem, wo a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">wonyɛ akumaa wɔ Yuda asafohene mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">wo mu na mɛyi deɛ ɔbɛdi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">me ɔman Israel anim afiri.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Ɔhene Herode frɛɛ anyansafoɔ no kɔkoam bisaa wɔn ɛberɛ pɔtee a wɔhunuu nsoromma no. Ɔtoaa so ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>“Monkɔ Betlehem nkɔhwehwɛ abɔfra no. Sɛ mohunu no a, mommɛka nkyerɛ me, na me nso menkɔsom no bi.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Anyansafoɔ no tiee ɔhene no asɛm no wieeɛ no, wɔkɔeɛ. Wɔrekɔ no, nsoromma a wɔhunuu wɔ apueeɛ no sane yii ne ho adi bio kyerɛɛ wɔn. Ɛdii wɔn anim kɔsii beaeɛ a wɔawo abɔfra no wɔ Betlehem hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔhunuu nsoromma no no, wɔn ani gyee mmoroso. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Wɔduruu efie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anyansafoɔ no ankɔhwɛ Yesu ɛberɛ a ɔda mmoa adididaka mu sɛdeɛ na amanneɛ te ne sɛdeɛ nnwanhwɛfoɔ no kɔhwɛɛ no no. Mmom, abosome bi akyi no, wɔkɔhwɛɛ “abɔfra” no wɔ ne “fie”.</char></note> a abɔfra no ne ne maame Maria wɔ no, wɔkoto sɔree no. Wɔde wɔn akyɛdeɛ a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ, aduhwam ne kurobo yɛɛ no ayɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Onyankopɔn soo wɔn daeɛ bɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ sɛ wɔnnsane nkɔ Herode nkyɛn bio wɔ Yerusalem. Enti wɔfaa ɛkwan foforɔ so kɔɔ wɔn kurom.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Wɔn Ho Adwaa Wɔ Misraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Anyansafoɔ no kɔeɛ akyiri no, Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ soo Yosef daeɛ sɛ, “Sɔre fa abɔfra no ne ne maame na monkɔ Misraim nkɔtena hɔ nkɔsi sɛ mɛkyerɛ mo ɛberɛ a mobɛsane aba. Ɛfiri sɛ, Ɔhene Herode rehwehwɛ abɔfra no akum no.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Anadwo no ara, Yosef faa abɔfra no ne Maria siim kɔɔ Misraim, <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>na wɔtenaa hɔ kɔsii sɛ Ɔhene Herode wuiɛ. Yei na ɛmaa deɛ Awurade nam odiyifoɔ no so kaeɛ sɛ, “Mafrɛ me Ba afiri Misraim” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Betlehem Mmɔfra No Kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Herode hunuu sɛ anyansafoɔ no adaadaa no no, ne bo fuu mmoroso. Ɔsomaa nʼasraafoɔ sɛ wɔnkɔ Betlehem ne nkuro a atwa ho ahyia no nyinaa mu nkɔkunkum mmadoma mmarimaa kɔsi wɔn a wɔadi mfeɛ mmienu so, sɛdeɛ anyansafoɔ no ɛberɛ a wɔkaa sɛ wɔwoo abɔfra no wɔ mu no kyerɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Deɛ wɔnam odiyifoɔ Yeremia so kaeɛ no baa mu sɛ,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Wɔte nne bi wɔ Rama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">Ɛyɛ osu ne agyaadwoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahel resu ne mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">na ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔkyekyere ne werɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnte ase bio”.<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsane Ba Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herode wuiɛ akyiri no, Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ Yosef wɔ daeɛ mu wɔ Misraim ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>“Sɔre na fa abɔfra no ne ne maame kɔ Israel asase so, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn a wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔkum abɔfra no awuwu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Yosef faa abɔfra no ne ne maame sane kɔɔ Israel asase so bio. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Yosef tee sɛ Arkelao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔhempɔn Herode ba yi dii adeɛ sɛ ɔhene wɔ Yudea ne Samaria mfirinhyia edu pɛ. (4 AWK–6 KAA) Na ɔyɛ otirimuɔdenfoɔ ne nhyɛsotrasoɔ. Yei ma wɔtuu no adeɛ so ma Yudea bɛyɛɛ Roma mantam a na wɔtua toɔ ma Roma Ɔhempɔn no ananmusini.</char></note> a ɔyɛ Herode ba na ɔdi ɔhene wɔ Yudea saa ɛberɛ no mu no, ɔsuroo sɛ ɔbɛkɔ hɔ. Awurade sane soo no daeɛ foforɔ bio sɛ ɔnnkɔ Yudea, na mmom, ɔnkɔ Galilea.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu berɛ so no, na Galilea da Ɔman Kronkron no atifi fam.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Enti, wɔkɔtenaa kuro Nasaret mu. Yei nso maa deɛ adiyifoɔ no kaeɛ sɛ, “Wɔbɛfrɛ no Nasareni” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu ne nʼawofoɔ wɔ Nasaret no, Yohane Osubɔni bɛkaa asɛm wɔ Yudea ɛserɛ so sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>“Monnu mo ho; momfa mo ho mma Onyankopɔn na ɔsoro ahennie no abɛn” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Yohane ne deɛ odiyifoɔ Yesaia kaa ne ho asɛm sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Nne bi reteam wɔ ɛserɛ so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Monsiesie ɛkwan mma Awurade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">momma nʼatempɔn ntene!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Yohane fira yoma ho nwi ntoma, bɔ aboa nhoma abɔsoɔ. Na nʼaduane yɛ ntutummɛ ne ɛwoɔ. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Yerusalemfoɔ ne Yudeafoɔ ne nnipa a wɔte Asubɔnten Yordan ho no nyinaa kɔɔ ne nkyɛn wɔ ɛserɛ no so hɔ kɔtiee asɛm no bi. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Wɔkaa wɔn bɔne ma ɔbɔɔ wɔn asu wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan mu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Yohane hunuu sɛ Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ pii reba ne nkyɛn ma wɔabɔ wɔn asu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Awɔ mma! Hwan na ɔka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ monnwane mfiri Onyankopɔn abufuo a ɛreba no ano? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Monkɔbɔ ɔbra pa mfa nkyerɛ sɛ moasakyera ampa. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Na monnhoahoa mo ho sɛ moyɛ Abraham asefoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn bɛtumi ama saa aboɔ yi adane nnipa ma wɔabɛyɛ Abraham asefoɔ. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Onyankopɔn de nʼabonnua ato dua biara a ɛnso aba pa nhini ho sɛ ɔde bɛtwa, na ɔde agu ogya mu ahye no.<verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>“Me deɛ, mede nsuo na ɛrebɔ wɔn a wɔasakyera wɔn su no asu. Nanso deɛ ɔdi mʼakyi reba no deɛ, ɔso sene me a ne mpaboa mpo mensɛ sɛ mekura. Ɔno deɛ, sɛ ɔba a, ɔde Honhom Kronkron ne ogya na ɛbɛbɔ mo asu. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Ɔbɛhuhu aburoo no so ayiyi mu aba pa no afiri ntɛtɛ no mu, na ɔde aba pa no akɔsie, na ɔde ogya a ɛnnum da ahye ntɛtɛ no pasaa.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asubɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Yesu tee Yohane Osubɔni nka no, ɔfiri Galilea baa Asubɔnten Yordan ho sɛ Yohane mmɔ no asu. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Yohane hunuu sɛ ɔmfata sɛ ɔbɔ Yesu asu. Yei enti, ɔkaa sɛ, “Wo na ɛsɛ sɛ wobɔ me asu, na ɛnyɛ me.”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Ɛnna Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛtwa ara na ɛtwa sɛ wobɔ me asu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a deɛ Onyankopɔn ahyɛ ato hɔ no bɛba mu.”</char> Yesu asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no enti, Yohane bɔɔ no asu.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Wɔbɔɔ Yesu asu wieeɛ no, ɔfirii nsuo no mu, na hwɛ ɔsoro bueɛ. Ɔhunuu Onyankopɔn Honhom sɛ ɛresiane ba ne so sɛ aborɔnoma. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Ɛhɔ ara, ɛnne bi firi ɔsoro kaa sɛ, “Yei ne me Dɔ Ba a ɔsɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbonsam Sɔ Yesu Hwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Yei akyi no, Honhom Kronkron faa Yesu kɔɔ ɛserɛ so sɛ ɔbonsam nkɔsɔ no nhwɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no mu, Yesu dii mmuada adaduanan awia ne anadwo. Yei maa ɛkɔm dee no. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Ɔbonsam baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba no a, ka na saa aboɔ yi nnane aduane.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ, ‘Ɛnyɛ aduane nko ara na ɛho hia onipa wɔ nʼasetena mu, na mmom, deɛ ɛhia titire ne Onyankopɔn asɛm.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Afei, ɔbonsam de Yesu kɔɔ Yerusalem de no kɔgyinaa asɔredan a ɛwɔ hɔ no atifi pɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba no ampa ara a, huri firi deɛ wogyina hɔ si fam, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“ ‘Onyankopɔn bɛsoma nʼabɔfoɔ abɛsɔ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">na woammɛhwe abotan so.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu buaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ, ‘Nsɔ Awurade wo Onyankopɔn nhwɛ.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Yei akyi no, ɔbonsam de Yesu kɔɔ bepɔ tenten bi apampam. Ɔde nʼani kari kyerɛɛ no ewiase ahennie ahodoɔ ne emu animuonyam nyinaa. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Sɛ wobɛkoto asom me a, mede deɛ wohunu yi nyinaa bɛma wo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Firi me so, Ɔbonsam! Hunu sɛ, wɔatwerɛ sɛ ‘Koto som Awurade, wo Onyankopɔn, na ɔno nko ara na som no.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Yesu ano siiɛ no, ɔbonsam gyaa no hɔ kɔeɛ. Ɛno akyi, abɔfoɔ baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛsom no.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Fiti Nʼadwuma Ase Wɔ Galilea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesu tee sɛ wɔakyere Yohane no, ɔkɔɔ Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Ɔduruu Galilea no, wantena Nasaret, na mmom, ɔtwaam Nasaret hɔ kɔtenaa Kapernaum a ɛwɔ Galilea mpoano no, Sebulon ne Naftali ahyeɛ so. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Yei maa deɛ Odiyifoɔ Yesaia kaeɛ sɛ,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Sebulon asase ne Naftali asase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">ɛpo ɛkwan so, Yordan agya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilea a amanamanfoɔ te hɔ,<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>nnipa a wɔte sum mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">Hann kɛseɛ bi apue ama wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Hann no apue ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">wɔn a wɔte owuo asase so.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, Yesu firii nʼasɛnka ase sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnu mo ho, momfa mo ho mma Onyankopɔn na ɔsoro ahennie no abɛn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Asuafoɔ Baanan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu nam Galilea mpoano no, ɔhunuu anuanom baanu bi a wɔn nyinaa yɛ afarefoɔ sɛ wɔregu asau ɛpo no mu. Saa anuanom yi mu baako din de Simon a ne din foforɔ nso de Petro. Ɔbaako no nso din de Andrea. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommɛdi mʼakyi na mɛkyerɛ mo ɛkwan a wɔfa so yi nnipa kra.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Ɛhɔ ara, wɔgyaa wɔn asau no guu hɔ bɛdii nʼakyi ne no kɔeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra no, ɔhunuu Sebedeo mma baanu a wɔfrɛ ɔbaako Yohane ɛnna ɔbaako nso din de Yakobo, sɛ wɔne wɔn agya te kodoɔ mu retuatua wɔn asau mu. Yesu frɛɛ wɔn nso sɛ wɔmmɛdi nʼakyi. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Ntɛm ara, wɔgyaa wɔn agya ne kodoɔ no hɔ bɛdii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galilea Asɛnka Ne Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu kyinkyinii Galileaman mu nyinaa kaa ahennie no ho asɛmpa wɔ Yudafoɔ hyiadan mu. Ɔsaa nyarewa ahodoɔ a wɔde baa nʼanim nyinaa nso. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Yesu anwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛeɛ yi trɛ kɔduruu Siriaman mu nyinaa. Yei maa wɔde wɔn a ahonhommɔne wɔ wɔn so, wɔn a wɔtwa, wɔn a wɔyare mmubuiɛ ne wɔn a nyarewa ahodoɔ ha wɔn no nyinaa firi Siriaman mu brɛɛ no ma ɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yadeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Anwanwadeɛ a Yesu yɛeɛ yi maa nnipakuo a wɔfiri Galilea ne Nkuro Edu “Dekapoli” no mu ne Yerusalem ne Yordan agya tu dii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhyira Nsɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Ɔhunuu nnipakuo no saa no, ɔkɔɔ bepɔ bi so. Ɔtenaa ase no, nʼasuafoɔ no kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ,<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔyɛ ahiafoɔ wɔ honhom mu,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na ɔsoro ahennie yɛ wɔn dea.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔn werɛ aho,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛkyekyere wɔn werɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne ahobrɛasefoɔ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛma wɔadi asase so.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔn pɛ ne sɛ wɔbɛyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛdeɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛma wɔn deɛ ɛhia wɔn.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔhunu mmɔbɔ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛhunu wɔn mmɔbɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔn akoma mu teɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na wɔbɛhunu Onyankopɔn.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne apatafoɔ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛfrɛ wɔn ne mma.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a ɛsiane sɛ wɔyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛdeɛ enti, wɔtaa wɔn,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Ɔsoro Ahennie no yɛ wɔn dea.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne mo a me din mu enti, wɔya mo, taa mo, twa atorɔ, ka asɛmmɔne to mo so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/><char style="wj">Momma mo ani nnye na monsɛpɛ mo ho, ɛfiri sɛ, mowɔ akatua a ɛso wɔ ɔsoro. Monhunu sɛ saa ara na wɔtaa adiyifoɔ a wɔdii mo ɛkan no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkyene Ne Kanea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mone asase yi so nkyene. Sɛ nkyene dɛ yera a, ɛkwan bɛn so na wɔbɛfa ama ayɛ nkyene bio? Ɛnyɛ mma hwee bio, gye sɛ wɔhwie gu na nnipa tiatia so.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mone ewiase kanea. Kuro a ɛda bepɔ so no ntumi nhinta.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/><char style="wj">Wɔnsɔ kanea mfa nsie, na mmom, wɔde si petee mu na ahyerɛn ama wɔn a wɔwɔ efie no mu no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na momma mo nneyɛeɛ pa nna adi mma nnipa nhunu na wɔnam so ahyɛ mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no animuonyam.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara No Mu Den Hyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnsusu sɛ maba sɛ merebɛsɛe Mmara no anaa Adiyifoɔ no nkyerɛkyerɛ no. Na mmom, maba sɛ merebɛhyɛ no ma sɛdeɛ ne nyinaa bɛba mu pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/><char style="wj">Monhunu sɛ ɔsoro ne asase da so wɔ hɔ yi, Mmara no mu biribiara rensakra da kɔsi sɛ ne nyinaa bɛba mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/><char style="wj">Yei enti, obiara a ɔbɛbu mmaransɛm no mu fa bi so, na ɔbɛkyerɛkyerɛ afoforɔ ama wɔn nso abu mmaransɛm no mu fa bi so no, ɔbɛyɛ akumaa ɔsoro ahennie mu. Na obiara a ɔbɛdi mmara no so, na ɔbɛkyerɛkyerɛ afoforɔ ama wɔn nso adi mmara no soɔ no, ɔbɛyɛ kɛseɛ Ɔsoro Ahennie mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/><char style="wj">Enti, merebɔ mo kɔkɔ sɛ, sɛ mopɛ sɛ mokɔ ɔsoro ahennie mu deɛ a, gye sɛ moyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛdeɛ sene deɛ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no ne Farisifoɔ no yɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abufuo Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Deɛ ɔdi awuo no, ɔno nso ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum no bi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ, deɛ mereka ne sɛ, obiara a ne bo bɛfu ne nua no, wɔbɛbu no atɛn. Bio, obiara a ɔbɛdi ne nua atɛm no, wɔbɛfrɛ no mpanin anim. Afei, obiara a ɔbɛka akyerɛ ne nua sɛ, ‘Ogyimifoɔ’ no, ɔbɛkɔ amanehunu ogya mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, sɛ ɛba sɛ worekɔbɔ afɔdeɛ na wokae sɛ wo ne wo nua wɔ asɛm a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/><char style="wj">gyae afɔdeɛ no bɔ, na kɔ na wo ne wo nua no nkɔbom ansa na woakɔbɔ wʼafɔdeɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wo ne obi nya asɛm a, wo ne no mmɔ mu ntɛm, na wamfa wo ankɔ asɛnniiɛ ankɔma ɔtemmufoɔ, na ɔtemmufoɔ no amfa wo anhyɛ afiasehwɛfoɔ nsa, na afiasehwɛfoɔ no amfa wo ankɔto afiase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɔde wo kɔ ɔtemmufoɔ anim a, kae sɛ, ansa na wobɛfiri asɛnniiɛ hɔ no, gye sɛ woatua sika biara a wɔregye afiri wo hɔ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adwamammɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Nsɛe awadeɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ, deɛ mereka ne sɛ: Obiara a ɔhunu ɔbaa na ne kɔn dɔ no nʼakoma mu no, abɔ adwaman.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wʼani baako a ɛyɛ to wo suntidua a, ɛyɛ sɛ wobɛtu ato atwene. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ sɛ wobɛhwere wʼakwaa fa bi sene sɛ wɔbɛto wo onipadua no nyinaa atwene amanehunu ogya mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ wo nsa a ɛyɛ to wo suntidua a, ɛyɛ sɛ wobɛtwa ato atwene ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ sɛ wobɛhwere wʼakwaa fa bi sene sɛ wɔbɛto wo onipadua nyinaa atwene amanehunu ogya mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awaregyaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Obiara a ɔbɛgyaa ne yere no mma no awaregyaeɛ krataa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ, deɛ mereka ne sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi gyaa ne yere a ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔbaa no abɔ adwaman, na ɔbaa no sane kɔware bio a, na ɔbarima a ɔgyaee no no ama ɔbaa no asɛe awadeɛ. Ɔbarima foforɔ a ɔbɛware ɔbaa no nso asɛe awadeɛ saa ara.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkasa Mu Nokorɛdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bio, Mose mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Mmu bɔ a woahyɛ Onyankopɔn no so, na mmom, di bɔ a woahyɛ no no so.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ, deɛ mereka ne sɛ: Monnka ntam mfa nhyɛ bɔ. Monnnɔ ɔsoro, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn ahennwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/><char style="wj">Monnnɔ fam, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn nan ase adwa. Monnnɔ Yerusalem, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ ɔhenkɛseɛ kuropɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/><char style="wj">Mfa wo tiri nka ntam, ɛfiri sɛ, worentumi nnane tirinwi baako mpo mma ɛnyɛ fitaa anaa tuntum.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/><char style="wj">Momma mo nsɛm nyɛ ‘Aane’ anaa ‘Dabi.’ Asɛm biara a wobɛka a ɛnyɛ aane anaa dabi no firi ɔbonsam.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aweretɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Sɛ obi tu wʼani a, tu ne deɛ bi. Sɛ obi tu wo se nso a, tu ne deɛ bi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ, deɛ mereka ne sɛ: Mommfa bɔne ntua bɔne so ka! Sɛ obi bɔ wʼaso nifa mu a, dane benkum no nso ma no na ɔmmɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi ne wo di asɛm gye wʼatadeɛ nhyɛaseɛ a, worɔ wʼatadeɛ nkatasoɔ ka ho ma no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi hyɛ wo sɛ, wo ne no nnante kwansin baako a, wo ne no nkɔ akwansini mmienu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi srɛ wo biribi a, fa ma no; obi pɛ sɛ ɔfɛm wo hɔ biribi a, fa fɛm no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɔ Wʼatamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moate sɛ wɔaka sɛ, ‘Dɔ wo yɔnko, na tane wʼatamfoɔ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ, deɛ mereka ne sɛ: monnɔ mo atamfoɔ, na mommɔ mpaeɛ mma wɔn a wɔha mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/><char style="wj">Yei bɛma mo ayɛ mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no mma, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔma nʼawia pue, ma ne nsuo tɔ ma nnipa bɔne ne nnipa pa nyinaa pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/><char style="wj">Sɛ modɔ wɔn a wɔdɔ mo no nko ara a, akatua bɛn na mobɛnya? Ɛnyɛ saa ara na nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nso yɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mokyea wɔn a monim wɔn nko ara a, nsonsonoeɛ bɛn na ɛda mo ne afoforɔ ntam? Ɛnyɛ saa ara na nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nso yɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/><char style="wj">Enti monyɛ pɛ sɛdeɛ mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no yɛ pɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Papayɛ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yie na moanyɛ papa ankyerɛ nnipa, amfa ampɛ animuonyam. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, morennya mfasoɔ biara mfiri mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ woyɛ papa a, mmɔ no dawuro sɛdeɛ nyaatwomfoɔ yɛ wɔ asɔredan mu ne mmɔntene so no. Merema mo ate sɛ, saa nnipa no anya wɔn akatua dada.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woyɛ papa a, mma obiara nhunu, mpo sɛ wode wo nsa nifa yɛ papa a, mma wo nsa benkum nhunu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/><char style="wj">na wʼagya a ɔnim kɔkoam nsɛm nyinaa no bɛtua wo ka.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpaeɛbɔ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛfa mpaeɛbɔ ho nso, sɛ morebɔ mpaeɛ a, mommmɔ mpaeɛ sɛdeɛ nyaatwomfoɔ gyina asɔredan mu ne mmɔntene so bɔ mpaeɛ de pɛ nnipa anim animuonyam no. Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, saa nnipa no anya wɔn akatua dada.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wobɔ mpaeɛ a, hɔ wo dan mu, na to wo ɛpono mu, na bɔ wʼAgya a wɔnhunu no mpaeɛ, na wʼAgya a ɔnim kɔkoam nsɛm no bɛtua wo ka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mobɔ mpaeɛ a, monnkasakasa bebree ntiti nsɛm mu, nsusu sɛ, sɛ moyɛ saa a na Onyankopɔn bɛtie mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/><char style="wj">Mo Agya Onyankopɔn nim deɛ ɛhia mo nyinaa ansa na mobisa no.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, saa ɛkwan yi so na momfa mmɔ mpaeɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Yɛn Agya a wowɔ ɔsoro,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">wo din ho nte.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>
    <char style="wj">Wʼahennie mmra.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">
    <char style="wj">Deɛ wopɛ nyɛ hɔ wɔ asase so,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">
    <char style="wj">sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ wɔ ɔsoro.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Ma yɛn yɛn daa aduane ɛnnɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>
    <char style="wj">na fa yɛn bɔne kyɛ yɛn,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">
    <char style="wj">sɛdeɛ yɛde wɔn a wɔfom yɛn no bɔne kyɛ wɔn no.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Mma yɛnkɔ sɔhwɛ mu.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <char style="wj">Na yi yɛn firi ɔbɔnefoɔ no nsam.’</char><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Sɛ mode wɔn a wɔfom mo mfomsoɔ kyɛ wɔn a, mo nso mo ɔsoro Agya de mo mfomsoɔ bɛkyɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ moamfa wɔn a wɔfom mo mfomsoɔ ankyɛ wɔn a, mo ɔsoro Agya no nso remfa mo mfomsoɔ nkyɛ mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmuadadie Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ modi mmuada a, monnyɛ mo anim mmɔbɔmmɔbɔ sɛdeɛ nyaatwomfoɔ mmuada a wɔyɛ de pɛ nnipa anim animuonyam no. Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, saa nnipa no anya wɔn akatua dada.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wodi mmuada a, nunu wo tirim, na hohoro wʼanim, na ma wʼanim nyɛ frɔmm,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/><char style="wj">na mma nnipa nhunu sɛ woredi mmuada, agye wʼAgya a ɔhunu deɛ woyɛ wɔ kɔkoam nyinaa no nko ara; na wʼAgya a ɔnim kɔkoam nsɛm nyinaa no bɛtua wo ka.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnhyehyɛ mo agyapadeɛ wɔ asase yi so, deɛ ntɛferɛ bɛtumi awe, na ɛbɛtumi awe nnaakye na asɛeɛ, na akorɔmfoɔ bɛtumi awia.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/><char style="wj">Mmom, monhyehyɛ mo agyapadeɛ wɔ ɔsoro, deɛ ntɛferɛ ntumi nwe, na ɛntumi nwe nnaakye nsɛeɛ, na akorɔmfoɔ ntumi nwia.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ wʼagyapadeɛ wɔ no, ɛhɔ na wʼakoma nso wɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ani yɛ onipadua kanea. Ɛno enti sɛ wʼani yɛ a, na wo onipadua nyinaa yɛ hann.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/><char style="wj">Nanso sɛ wʼani nyɛ a, ɛma wo onipadua no nyinaa dane esum tumm. Enti, sɛ hann a ɛwɔ wo mu no yɛ esum deɛ a, na wo onipadua no yɛ esum kabii.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara ntumi nsom awuranom baanu; sɛ ɔyɛ saa a, ɔbɛtan ɔbaako, na wadɔ ɔbaako anaasɛ ɔbɛsom ɔbaako yie, na wabu ɔbaako animtia. Morentumi nsom Onyankopɔn ne ahodeɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yei enti na metu mo fo sɛ, monnnwennwene deɛ mobɛdi anaa deɛ mobɛnom anaa deɛ mobɛfira ho. Mowɔ ɔkra ne onipadua a ɛsom bo sene deɛ mobɛdi, deɛ mobɛnom ne deɛ mobɛfira.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ ewiem nnomaa, wɔnnua aba ɛnna wɔntwa aba mmoaboa ano mfa nsie, nanso mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no ma wɔn aduane di. Monnsom bo nsene wɔn anaa?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/><char style="wj">Mo mu hwan na adwene a ɔdwen no bɛtumi ato ne nkwa nna so simasin?</char><verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na modwennwene ntoma ho? Monhwɛ afifideɛ bi sɛ sukooko. Wɔnnyɛ adwuma, anaasɛ wɔnwene ntoma ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/><char style="wj">Nanso, Ɔhene Salomo ahonya ne nʼanimuonyam nyinaa akyi no, na nʼahoɔfɛ nnuru sukooko yi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ Onyankopɔn tumi fira afifideɛ a ɛwɔ hɔ ɛnnɛ na ɔkyena ɛnni hɔ ntoma a, mo a mo gyidie sua, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔrentumi mma mo deɛ ɛhia mo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/><char style="wj">Enti, monnnwennwene deɛ mobɛdie, deɛ mobɛnom anaasɛ deɛ mobɛfira ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wɔnni gyidie no na ɛberɛ biara wɔdwene saa nneɛma no ho. Na mo deɛ, mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nim sɛ yeinom nyinaa ho hia mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/><char style="wj">Enti, monhwehwɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie ne ne tenenee kane, na ɔde deɛ ɛhia mo nyinaa bɛka mo ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/><char style="wj">Enti, monnnwennwene ɔkyena ho. Onyankopɔn no ara de deɛ ɛhia mo bɛma mo. Ɛda biara ne mu nsɛm.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Atɛnyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommmu ntɛn, na afoforɔ ammu mo ntɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/><char style="wj">Deɛ mode yɛ afoforɔ no, ɛno ara na wɔde bɛyɛ mo.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn na woma aboseaa a ɛda wo nua ani so no ha wo, ɛberɛ a ɛboɔ kɛseɛ da wo deɛ so?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/><char style="wj">Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na woatumi aka akyerɛ wo nua sɛ, ‘Ma menyi aboseaa a ɛda wʼani so no mma wo,’ wɔ ɛberɛ a ɛboɔ da wʼani so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/><char style="wj">Nyaatwomni! Di ɛkan yi ɛboɔ a ɛda wʼani so no ansa na woatumi ahunu aboseaa a ɛda wo nua ani so ayi ama no.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommfa deɛ ɛho te mma nkraman. Saa ara nso na monnto mo nhwene pa ngu mprako anim! Wɔbɛtiatia so, na woadane wɔn ho ato ahyɛ mo so.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisa, Hwehwɛ, Pem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommisa, na wɔbɛma mo; monhwehwɛ, na mobɛhunu; mompem, na wɔbɛbue mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbisa no, ɔnya. Obiara a ɔhwehwɛ no, ɔhunu; na deɛ ɔpem no, wɔbue no.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na hwan na ne ba bisa no burodo a ɔbɛma no ɛboɔ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/><char style="wj">Anaasɛ ɔbisa no nsuomnam a ɔbɛma no ɔwɔ? Ɛremma saa da!</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mo a moyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ mpo nim sɛdeɛ moma mo mma nnepa a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no mfa nnepa mma ne mma a wɔbisa no no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/><char style="wj">Enti, sɛdeɛ mmara no ne adiyifoɔ no ka no, adeɛ biara a mopɛ sɛ nnipa nyɛ mma mo no, mo nso monyɛ mma wɔn saa ara.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkwan Teateaa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛkwan teateaa no nko ara so na wobɛtumi afa akɔ ɔsoro! Ɛkwan a ɛkɔ ɔbonsam kurom no trɛ, na nʼapono nso mu baeɛ ma nnipadɔm a wɔfa so kɔ ɔsɛeɛ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/><char style="wj">Ɛpono a wɔwura mu de kɔ nkwa mu no yɛ ketewa na ɛkwan a wɔfa so no nso yɛ teateaa, na nnipa kakra bi na wɔhunu fa so.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho yie wɔ atorɔ akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a wɔba mo nkyɛn ahobrɛaseɛ mu sɛ nnwan nanso wɔyɛ mpataku a wɔnya mo a, wɔbɛtete mo pasaa no ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/><char style="wj">Wɔn nneyɛeɛ na mode bɛhunu wɔn, sɛdeɛ motumi de dua bi aba hunu dua ko a ɛyɛ no. Worentumi nte bobe wɔ nkasɛɛ so; saa ara nso na worentumi nte borɔdɔma wɔ nnɛnkyɛmse so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/><char style="wj">Dua a ɛwɔ nnyinasoɔ pa no tumi so aba pa; na dua a ɛnni nnyinasoɔ pa no nso so aba bɔne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/><char style="wj">Dua pa ntumi nso aba bɔne saa ara nso na dua bɔne ntumi nso aba pa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/><char style="wj">Dua biara a ɛnso aba pa no, wɔtwa de gu ogya mu hye no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/><char style="wj">Onipa nneyɛeɛ na ɛma yɛhunu ne suban.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ obiara a ɔbɔ me din ‘Awurade, Awurade’ no na ɔbɛkɔ ɔsoro ahennie mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, nnipa pii bɛka akyerɛ me sɛ, ‘Awurade, yɛkaa wo ho asɛm kyerɛɛ afoforɔ. Yɛnam wo din nso so tuu ahonhommɔne, sane yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ, ahodoɔ’.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/><char style="wj">Na mabua wɔn sɛ, ‘mennim mo da. Momfiri me so nkɔ, nnebɔneyɛfoɔ!’</char><verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔn a wɔtie deɛ meka, na wɔdi so no te sɛ onyansafoɔ a ɔsi ne dan si ɔbotan so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/><char style="wj">Sɛ osuo tɔ, na osuframa bɔ, na nsuo yiri, na emu biara ka ɛdan no a, ɛremmu da ɛfiri sɛ, wɔsi sii ɔbotan so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wɔn a wɔtie deɛ meka na wɔnni soɔ no te sɛ ɔkwasea bi a ɔsii ne dan sii anwea so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/><char style="wj">Sɛ osuo tɔ, na osuframa bɔ, na nsuo yiri, na emu biara ka ɛdan no a, ɛbɛdwiri agu fam, abubu pasaa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu asɛnka no maa nnipadɔm a wɔtiee no no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ sɛ obi a ɔkura tumi na ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no nte sɛ deɛ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no kyerɛ no.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu sianee bepɔ no no, nnipadɔm bebree dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Ɔkwatani bi baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛkotoo no, srɛɛ no sɛ, “Me wura, mesrɛ wo, sɛ ɛyɛ wo pɛ a, sa me yadeɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu tenee ne nsa de kaa ɔkwatani no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mɛsa wo yadeɛ. Kwata, firi ne ho kɔ!”</char> Amonom hɔ ara, kwata no firii ne ho. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo ne obiara nni wʼayaresa yi ho nkɔmmɔ. Kɔ na fa wo ho kɔkyerɛ ɔsɔfoɔ, na bɔ afɔdeɛ a Mose hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmmɔ sɛ adansedie no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu kɔɔ Kapernaum. Ɔduruu hɔ no, Roma asraafoɔ panin bi a ɛdɔm hyɛ nʼase baa ne kyɛn bɛbuu no nkotodwe kaa sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>“Awurade, mʼabɔfra abubu gu hɔ a ɔrehunu amane; mesrɛ wo, bɛsa no yadeɛ ma me.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mɛba abɛsa no yadeɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Asraafoɔ panin no tee Yesu asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no, ɔkaa sɛ, “Awurade, memfata sɛ woba me fie. Ka biribi na mʼabɔfra no ho bɛyɛ no den. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Meyɛ ɔsraani a mehyɛ tumi ase, na mesane wɔ asraafoɔ a wɔhyɛ mʼase. Meka kyerɛ wɔn mu bi sɛ ɔnkɔ a, ɔkɔ. Meka kyerɛ ɔfoforɔ sɛ ɔmmra a, ɔba. Saa ara nso na sɛ meka kyerɛ mʼabɔfra sɛ ɔnyɛ biribi a, ɔyɛ ara no no.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu tee saa asɛm yi no, ɛyɛɛ no nwanwa. Ɔdanee nʼani, ka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm a wɔdi nʼakyi no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Israelman mu nyinaa, menhunuu gyidie a ɛte sei da.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/><char style="wj">Na mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, nnipa pii bɛfiri apueeɛ ne atɔeɛ aba, na wɔne Abraham, Isak ne Yakob ato nsa adidi wɔ ɔsoro ahennie no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/><char style="wj">Na Israelfoɔ a wɔsiesiee ɔsoro ahennie maa wɔn no mu pii wɔ hɔ a wɔbɛto wɔn agu esum kabii mu, na wɔde wɔn nsa bɛgu wɔn tiri atwa agyaadwoɔ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Yesu ka kyerɛ asraafoɔ panin no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ efie. Deɛ wogye die no aba mu ama wo!”</char> Saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu, abɔfra no ho tɔɔ no!<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Petro Ase Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesu kɔɔ Petro fie. Ɔkɔtoo sɛ huraeɛ akyere Petro ase baa ma ɔda hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Yesu sɔɔ ne nsa na amonom, huraeɛ no tu firii ne so. Ɔsɔre noaa aduane maa wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Saa ɛda no anwummerɛ no, wɔde wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonhommɔne pii brɛɛ Yesu. Nʼanom asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no maa ahonhommɔne no nyinaa tu yeraeɛ, na wɔn a wɔyare no nyinaa nso ho tɔɔ wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Yei maa deɛ Odiyifoɔ Yesaia kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Ɔfaa yɛn ahoɔmmerɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">na ɔsoaa yɛn nyarewa nyinaa” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyiridie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ ɛdɔm no redɔɔso no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, wɔntwa nkɔ asuogya nohoa. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Ɛhɔ ara Yudani ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ bi ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛdi wʼakyiri!”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sakraman wɔ abɔn, ewiem nnomaa nso wɔ mpirebuo, nanso me, Onipa Ba no deɛ, menni baabi a mede me tiri to!”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Asuafoɔ no mu baako bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, ma me kwan na menkɔsie mʼagya ansa na mʼabɛdi wʼakyi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Nanso, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Di mʼakyi. Wɔn a wɔawu no nsie wɔn awufoɔ”</char>.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Brɛ Ahum Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesu saa nyarewa no wieeɛ no, ɔkɔtenaa kodoɔ mu na nʼasuafoɔ no dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Prɛko pɛ, ahum kɛseɛ bi tuiɛ maa asorɔkye bu bɛkataa kodoɔ no so. Nanso, na Yesu deɛ, wada. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Nʼasuafoɔ no de nteateamu kɔɔ ne nkyɛn, kɔnyanee no kaa sɛ, “Awurade! Gye yɛn na yɛreyɛ amem!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesu nyaneeɛ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo a mo gyidie sua, adɛn na moabɔ hu saa?”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, ɔsɔre teateaa ahum ne asorɔkye no ma ɛyɛɛ dinn.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Asuafoɔ no ho dwirii wɔn yie. Wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Onipa bɛn mpo ni a ahum ne ɛpo tie no yi?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tu Ahonhommɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no duruu asuogya wɔ Gadarafoɔ asase so no, nnipa baanu bi a ahonhommɔne wɔ wɔn so firi amusieeɛ bɛhyiaa no. Esiane sɛ na saa nnipa yi yɛ keka enti, na obiara ntumi mfa faako a wɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Wɔhunuu no pɛ, wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ teateaam sɛ, “Onyankopɔn Ba, ɛdeɛn na worehwehwɛ afiri yɛn nkyɛn? Woaba ha sɛ worebɛyɛ yɛn ayayadeɛ ɛberɛ a mmerɛ no nsoeɛ anaa?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu na mprakokuo bi redidi wɔ nkyɛn baabi. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Ahonhommɔne no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Sɛ wotu yɛn a, fa yɛn kɔhyɛ mprakokuo yi mu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesu tiaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momfiri!”</char> Ɛhɔ ara ahonhommɔne no firii nnipa no mu, kɔwuraa mprako no mu. Mprakokuo no nyinaa de mmirika sianee bepɔ no, kɔguu ɛpo no mu ma ɛfaa wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Ntɛm ara, wɔn a wɔhwɛ mprako no so no tuu mmirika kɔɔ kurom, kɔkaa deɛ asie no kyerɛɛ nkurɔfoɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Kurom hɔfoɔ no tee deɛ aba no, wɔbɔɔ twi, kɔɔ deɛ Yesu wɔ hɔ no. Wɔhunuu Yesu no, wɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔmfiri wɔn ɔman mu hɔ nkɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Obubuafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yei akyi no, Yesu kɔtenaa kodoɔ bi mu kɔɔ Kapernaum, kuro a ɔte mu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Ɔduruu hɔ no, ankyɛre biara na nnipa bi de obubuafoɔ bi brɛɛ no sɛ ɔnsa no yadeɛ. Na Yesu hunuu gyidie a wɔwɔ wɔ ne mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ obubuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔba, ma wʼani nnye, wɔde wo bɔne nyinaa akyɛ wo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Ɛhɔ ara na Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ no bi teaam sɛ, “Ɔbarima yi ka abususɛm. Ɔkyerɛ sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu hunuu deɛ ɛwɔ wɔn adwenem no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na modwene bɔne ho saa?</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/><char style="wj">Me Onipa Ba no, mewɔ tumi wɔ asase yi so sɛ metumi de bɔne kyɛ. Deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛyɛ den, sɛ obi bɛka sɛ, ‘Mede wo bɔne akyɛ wo’ anaasɛ ɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Sɔre na nante?’ ”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Nanso, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ na mobɛhunu sɛ Onipa Ba no wɔ tumi sɛ ɔde bɔne kyɛ enti, ɔka kyerɛɛ obubuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre na bobɔ wo kɛtɛ, na kɔ efie ɛfiri sɛ, masa wo yadeɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Amonom hɔ ara, obubuafoɔ no sɔre bobɔɔ ne kɛtɛ, siim kɔɔ ne fie! <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Nnipadɔm no hunuu anwanwadeɛ yi no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn yie. Wɔkamfoo Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔde tumi a ɛte saa ama onipa!<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Mateo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu firi deɛ ɔsaa obubuafoɔ no yadeɛ hɔ rekɔ no, ɔhunuu ɔbarima ɔtogyeni bi a ɔte atogyeeɛ. Wɔfrɛ saa ɔbarima no Mateo. Yesu hunuu no no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛdi mʼakyi.”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, Mateo sɔre dii Yesu akyi.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Ɛbaa sɛ Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no kɔɔ Mateo fie kɔdidiiɛ. Wɔredidi no, ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ bebree baa hɔ ne no ne nʼasuafoɔ no too nsa didiiɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Farisifoɔ no hunuu sɛ ɔne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ ato nsa redidi no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ. Wɔbisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na mo ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no de ne ho abɔ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ a wɔte sɛɛ yi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesu teeɛ no, ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa a wɔnyare no, ɔyaresafoɔ ho nhia wɔn, na nnipa a wɔyare no na ɔyaresafoɔ ho hia wɔn.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Ɔsane kaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkɔhwehwɛ yei ase wɔ Atwerɛ Kronkron no mu. Wɔatwerɛ sɛ, ‘Ɛnyɛ mo afɔdeɛ ne ayɛyɛdeɛ na mepɛ, na mmom, ahummɔborɔ.’ Mammɛfrɛ teneneefoɔ, na mmom, mebɛfrɛɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ sɛ wɔnsakra mmra Onyankopɔn nkyɛn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmuadadie Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Ɛda bi, Yohane Osubɔni asuafoɔ baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wʼasuafoɔ no nni mmuada, sɛdeɛ yɛne Farisifoɔ di mmuada no?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mogye di sɛ, sɛ ayeforɔkunu ne ne nnamfonom te hɔ a, ɛsɛ sɛ ne nnamfonom no werɛ ho, na wɔbua da anaa? Ɛberɛ bi bɛba a wɔbɛfa me afiri wɔn nkyɛn. Saa ɛberɛ no na wɔbɛdi mmuada.</char><verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hwan na ɔde ntoma foforɔ bɛtare ntoma dada mu? Saa ntaremu no bɛsuane dada no mu ama tokuro kɛseɛ abɛda hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/><char style="wj">Hwan na ɔde nsã foforɔ bɛgu aboa nwoma nsã nkotokuo dada mu? Sɛ ɔyɛ saa a, nsã no bɛpae nkotokuo no ama nsã no ahwie agu, na nkotokuo no nso asɛe. Nsa nkotokuo foforɔ mu nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsã foforɔ gugu na amma nkotokuo no ne nsã no mu biara ansɛe.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa Bi Ayaresa Ne Ababaawa Bi Wunyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesu gu so rekasa no, Yudafoɔ panin bi ba bɛkoto, sɔree no. Ɔde nʼadesrɛdeɛ too Yesu anim sɛ, “Me babaa awu seesei ara. Menim sɛ, sɛ woba de wo nsa bɛka no pɛ a, ɔbɛnyane.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no ne ɔpanin no siim sɛ wɔrekɔ ɔpanin no fie.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Wɔrekɔ no, ɔbaa bi a mogya atu no mfirinhyia dumienu firii Yesu akyi sɔɔ nʼatadeɛ ano. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Ɔkaa wɔ ne tirim sɛ, “Sɛ mede me nsa ka no nko ara a, me ho bɛyɛ me den.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu danee nʼani ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbabaa, ma wo bo ntɔ wo yam. Wo gyidie agye wo. Wo ho atɔ wo.”</char> Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no mu, ne ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesu duruu ɔpanin no fie hɔ a ɔhunuu sɛ nkurɔfoɔ no bi resu na ebinom reto ayiase nnwom no, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara mfiri adi. Ababaawa no nwuiɛ. Wada!”</char> Yesu asɛm a ɔkaeɛ yi maa nnipa no seree no. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Nnipa no nyinaa firii adi no, Yesu kɔɔ faako a ababaawa no da hɔ no. Ɔsɔɔ ne nsa. Prɛko pɛ, ababaawa no nyaneeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Saa anwanwadeɛ a Yesu yɛeɛ yi trɛɛ wɔ mpɔtam hɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anifirafoɔ Baanu Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesu firi deɛ ɔnyanee ababaawa no hɔ rekɔ no, anifirafoɔ baanu bi dii nʼakyi teateaam sɛ, “Dawid ba, hunu yɛn mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesu duruu efie no, anifirafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn. Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mogye di sɛ mɛtumi ama moahunu adeɛ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Aane, Awurade, yɛgye di!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Yesu de ne nsa kaa wɔn ani kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo gyidie nyɛ deɛ mohwehwɛ mma mo!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Amonom hɔ ara na wɔn ani buebueeɛ. Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnka saa ayaresa yi ho asɛm nkyerɛ obiara.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Nanso, nnipa no firi hɔ pɛ, wɔbɔɔ asɛm no dawuro.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mumu Bɔdamfoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ refiri adi no, wɔde mumu bi a honhommɔne wɔ ne so brɛɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Yesu tuu honhommɔne no na prɛko pɛ, mumu no kasaeɛ. Saa honhommɔne tuo yi yɛɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa nwanwa ma wɔkaa sɛ, “Yɛnhunuu saa anwanwadeɛ yi bi da wɔ Israelman mu ha!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Farisifoɔ no deɛ, wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɔbonsam de honhommɔne ahyɛ no ma enti na ɔtumi tu ahonhommɔne no.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayamhyehyeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu kyinkyinii nkuro so ne nkuraa ase kaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛmpa wɔ wɔn hyiadan mu. Baabiara a ɔkɔeɛ no, ɔsaa nyarewa ahodoɔ bebree. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu hunuu nnipadɔm no, ne yam hyehyee no maa wɔn ɛfiri sɛ, ɔhunuu sɛ ɔhaw ahodoɔ gu wɔn so a, wɔnhunu deɛ wɔnyɛ ne deɛ wɔmfa a wɔbɛnya mmoa nso. Wɔte sɛ nnwan a wɔnni ɔhwɛfoɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Ɛha na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Otwa adwuma no dɔɔso, na adwumayɛfoɔ no deɛ, wɔsua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/><char style="wj">Enti, monsrɛ adwumawura no na ɔmma adwumayɛfoɔ bebree mmra ne twa adwuma no mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Asuafoɔ Dumienu No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ dumienu no baa ne nkyɛn, na ɔmaa wɔn tumi sɛ wɔntu ahonhommɔne na wɔnsa nyarewa ne ahoɔmmerɛ nyinaa.<verse eid="MAT 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Yesu asuafoɔ dumienu no din nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 10:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">Simon a ne din baako ne Petro ne ne nua Andrea;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">Yakobo ne ne nua Yohane a wɔyɛ Sebedeo mma no,<verse eid="MAT 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filipo ne Bartolomeo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">Toma ne ɔtogyefoɔ Mateo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">Yakobo, Alfeo ba ɛne Tadeo,<verse eid="MAT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simon a ɔfiri Kana ne Yuda Iskariot a akyire yi, ɔyii Yesu maeɛ no.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesu somaa asuafoɔ dumienu no hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnkɔ deɛ amanamanmufoɔ wɔ anaa Samariafoɔ kuro biara mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/><char style="wj">na mmom, monkɔ Onyankopɔn nnwan a wɔwɔ Israel a wɔayera no nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/><char style="wj">Monkɔka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn Ahennie no abɛn!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/><char style="wj">Monsa ayarefoɔ yadeɛ, monnyane awufoɔ, momma akwatafoɔ ho nte, na montu ahonhommɔne. Sɛdeɛ monyaa no kwa no, saa ara na mo nso momfa mma kwa.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommfa sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ anaa kɔbere biara mmɔ mo ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/><char style="wj">Mommfa akwantubɔtɔ anaa ntadeɛ anaa mpaboa anaa poma mmienu. Ɛsɛ sɛ odwumayɛfoɔ didi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/><char style="wj">Kuro biara a mobɛkɔ mu anaa akuraa biara a mobɛkɔ aseɛ no, monhwehwɛ onipa a onyamesuro wɔ ne mu akyiri kwan na montena ne nkyɛn kɔsi da a mobɛfiri hɔ akɔ baabi foforɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mokɔ efie bi mu a, monkyea wɔn sɛ, ‘Asomdwoeɛ nka mo!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/><char style="wj">Sɛ saa efie no mufoɔ gye mo fɛ so a, monhyira wɔn, na sɛ wɔannye mo deɛ a, monnhyira wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛ morefiri efie anaa kuro biara a wɔannye mo wɔ mu no mu akɔ a, momporoporo efie no anaa kuro no mu mfuturo a ɛwɔ mo nan ase no ngu hɔ.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yei yɛ deɛ Farisifoɔ yɛ ɛberɛ a wɔfiri beaeɛ biara a wɔbu sɛ aman amanmufoɔ atena hɔ enti ɛhɔ agu fi. Ɛyɛ kɔkɔbɔ a emu yɛ dene ma wɔn a wɔpo Awurade asɛm.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/><char style="wj">Nokorɛ nie, Atemmuo da no, Sodom ne Gomora mpo bɛnya baabi agyina wɔ Onyankopɔn anim sene saa kuro no.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monkae sɛ meresoma mo sɛ nnwan akɔ mpataku mu. Monyɛ anifire sɛ awɔ na monnwo sɛ mmorɔnoma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/><char style="wj">Nanso, monhwɛ yie wɔ nnipa ho! Wɔbɛkyere mo, adi mo asɛm, abɔ mo mmaa wɔ wɔn asɔredan mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/><char style="wj">Me enti, wɔde mo bɛkɔ atumfoɔ ne ahene anim. Yei bɛma mo anya ɛkwan aka asɛmpa no akyerɛ wɔn ne amanamanmufoɔ no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔkyere mo a, monnnwene asɛm a mobɛka de ayi mo ho ano. Wɔde asɛm a mobɛka no bɛma mo ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a mobɛka no remfiri mo, na mmom, mo ɔsoro Agya no honhom na ɔnam mo so bɛkasa.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Onua bɛyi onua ama sɛ wɔakum no. Saa ara na agyanom nso bɛyi wɔn mma ama. Mma bɛsɔre atia wɔn awofoɔ ama wɔakum wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/><char style="wj">Me enti, nnipa nyinaa bɛtan mo. Nanso, deɛ ɔbɛtumi agyina pintinn akɔsi awieeɛ no, wɔbɛgye no nkwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔtaa mo kuro baako mu a, monnwane nkɔ kuro foforɔ mu. Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, morenwie Israel nkuro nyinaa mu adwumayɛ ansa na Onipa Ba no aba.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Osuani nsene ne ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, na akoa nso nsene ne wura.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/><char style="wj">Osuani sua ne ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, na akoa nso sua ne wura. Enti, sɛ me a meyɛ efie no ti no wɔfrɛ me ‘Ɔbonsam’ a, ɛdeɛn din na wɔremfa mfrɛ mo!</char><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnsuro wɔn a wɔbɛhunahuna mo. Mmerɛ bi bɛba a nokorɛ no bɛda adi. Deɛ wɔyɛ no kɔkoam no nyinaa bɛda adi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/><char style="wj">Deɛ mereka makyerɛ mo wɔ esum mu yi, monka wɔ hann mu. Deɛ mereka agu mo asom yi, mompae mu nka wɔ adan atifi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/><char style="wj">Monnsuro wɔn a wɔbɛtumi akum mo onipadua nanso wɔrentumi nkum mo kra no. Onyankopɔn a ɔbɛtumi akum onipadua no ne ɔkra wɔ amanehunu kurom no nko ara na monsuro no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/><char style="wj">Wɔtɔn akasanoma gye ahe? Mmienu boɔ nyɛ sika bi pɛ? Nanso akasanoma biara nni hɔ a ɔbɛwu a mo Agya no nnim ho biribi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/><char style="wj">Mo tirinwi mpo, wɔakan ne nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/><char style="wj">Enti, monnsuro! Mosom bo ma Onyankopɔn sene nkasanoma.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔbɛka sɛ ɔnim me nnipa anim no, me nso mɛka sɛ menim no mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no anim.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/><char style="wj">Nanso, obiara a ɔbɛka sɛ ɔnnim me nnipa anim no, me nso mɛka sɛ mennim no wɔ mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no anim.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyɛ Asomdwoeɛ, Ɛyɛ Ɔko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnsusu sɛ mede asomdwoeɛ na ɛbaa asase yi so! Ɛnyɛ asomdwoeɛ na mmom akofena na mede baeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/><char style="wj">Maba sɛ mɛma</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ɔbabarima asɔre atia nʼagya,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="wj">na ɔbabaa asɔre atia ne maame,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="wj">na ɔbaa warefoɔ nso asɔre atia nʼasebaa.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>
    <char style="wj">Obiara ɔtamfoɔ a ne ho yɛ hu no bɛfiri nʼankasa ne fie.’</char><verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɔdɔ nʼagya anaa ne maame kyɛn me no rentumi nyɛ me deɛ. Saa ara na deɛ ɔdɔ ne babarima anaa ne babaa kyɛn me no rentumi nyɛ me deɛ ara no no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi amfa nʼasɛnnua na wammɛdi mʼakyi a, ɔrentumi nyɛ me deɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woma wo ɔkra som wo bo a, wobɛhwere wo ɔkra no, nanso sɛ me enti wohwere wo ɔkra a, wo nsa bɛka.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔgye mo no gye me, na deɛ ɔgye me no nso gye Onyankopɔn a ɔsomaa me no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wogye odiyifoɔ bi sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn onipa enti a, wɔbɛtua wo so ka sɛ odiyifoɔ no ara pɛ. Na sɛ wogye nnipa tenenee a, wobɛnya akatua sɛ onipa tenenee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbɛma mʼakyidifoɔ yi mu akumaa bi nsuo anom no, onii no akatua remmɔ no da.”</char><verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni Ahoyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu wiee nʼasuafoɔ dumienu no kasakyerɛ no, ɔfirii hɔ kɔɔ nkuro a ɛbemmɛn no mu kɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ asɛm no.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Yohane Osubɔni a saa ɛberɛ no na ɔda afiase no tee anwanwadeɛ a Kristo reyɛ no, ɔsomaa nʼasuafoɔ bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>“Wo ne deɛ ɔreba no, anaa yɛnhwɛ ɔfoforɔ anim?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monsane nkɔ, nkɔka anwanwadeɛ a moahunu ne deɛ moate nkyerɛ Yohane sɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/><char style="wj">anifirafoɔ hunu adeɛ, mmubuafoɔ nante, akwatafoɔ ho ate, asotifoɔ te asɛm, na awufoɔ nso nyane. Afei, monka nkyerɛ no sɛ, meka asɛmpa no kyerɛ ahiafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/><char style="wj">Monsane nka nkyerɛ no bio sɛ, Nhyira ne deɛ merenyɛ no suntidua.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Yohane asuafoɔ no kɔeɛ no, Yesu hyɛɛ aseɛ kaa Yohane ho asɛm kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mokɔɔ ɛserɛ so no, ɛdeɛn na mokɔɔ sɛ morekɔhwɛ? Ɛserɛ a mframa rebɔ no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/><char style="wj">Anaa na mosusu sɛ mobɛhunu ɔbarima bi a wahyehyɛ sɛ ɔhene ba te ahemfie?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/><char style="wj">Anaa Onyankopɔn odiyifoɔ? Ɛnneɛ, mereka makyerɛ mo sɛ, ɔsene odiyifoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/><char style="wj">Na saa Yohane yi na Atwerɛsɛm no ka fa ne ho sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mɛsoma me ɔbɔfoɔ adi wʼanim ɛkan.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">Ɔno na ɔbɛsiesie ɛkwan ama wo.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Nokorɛ nie, nnipa a mmaa awo wɔn nyinaa mu, obiara nni hɔ a ɔyɛ kɛse sene Yohane Osubɔni. Nanso, deɛ ɔyɛ aketewa koraa wɔ Ɔsoro Ahennie mu no yɛ ɔkɛseɛ sene no!</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/><char style="wj">Na ɛfiri ɛberɛ a Yohane Osubɔni firii aseɛ kaa asɛmpa no, bɔɔ nkurɔfoɔ asu de bɛsi ɛnnɛ no, Ɔsoro Ahennie no de tumi retrɛ na nnipadɔm a wɔn ani abereɛ refa no aniɛden so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/><char style="wj">Ansa na Yohane rebɛba no, na adiyifoɔ ne Mose mmara no aka ɔsoro ahennie no ho asɛm dada.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mopɛ sɛ mote deɛ mereka no ase deɛ a, Yohane no, ɔno ne Elia a adiyifoɔ no hyɛɛ ne ho nkɔm sɛ ɔbɛba no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no, ɔntie!</char><verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn ho na mɛtumi de nnɛmmafoɔ yi atoto? Wɔte sɛ mmɔfra a wɔte baabi redi agorɔ. Ɛfa ka kyerɛ ɛfa sɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Yɛtoo anigyeɛ nnwom maa mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">nanso moansa.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">Yɛtoo awerɛhoɔ nnwom nso maa mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">nanso moansu.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Yohane baeɛ a ɔnnidi na ɔnnom no, wɔse, ‘Ɔwɔ honhommɔne.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no baeɛ a ɔdidi na ɔnom no nso, wɔse, ‘Monhwɛ odidifoɔ ne ɔsanomfoɔ a ɔyɛ ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ adamfo!’ Nanso, wɔn a wɔdi Onyankopɔn akyi nokorɛ mu no deɛ, wɔn bra di adanseɛ sɛ, nʼakwan nyinaa yɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Korasin, Betsaida Ne Kapernaum, Monnue!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Afei, ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kaa nkuro a ɔyɛɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ wɔ hɔ nanso wɔannu wɔn ho no anim sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/><char style="wj">“Korasin, due! Betsaida, due! Anwanwadeɛ a meyɛɛ no mo mu no, sɛ meyɛɛ no Tiro ne Sidon a, anka ɛhɔfoɔ no de awerɛhoɔ ne ahonuo asakyera wɔn adwene dada.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, asɛm a ɛbɛto wɔn no bɛsene deɛ ɛbɛto Tiro ne Sidon!</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/><char style="wj">Na wo Kapernaum, wopɛ sɛ woma wo ho so, nanso wɔbɛbrɛ wo ase de wo akɔ asaman. Anwanwadeɛ a meyɛɛ no wo hɔ no, sɛ wɔyɛɛ no wɔ Sodom a, anka ɛda so wɔ hɔ bɛsi ɛnnɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, Atemmuo da no, Tiro ne Sodom bɛnya gyinabea pa asene mo!”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agya No Ayɛyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Asɛnka no akyi, Yesu bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Agya, ɔsoro ne asasewura, meda wo ase sɛ woanna nokorɛ no adi ankyerɛ wɔn a wɔsusu sɛ wɔyɛ anyansafoɔ, na mmom, wodaa nokorɛ no adi kyerɛɛ mmɔfra nkumaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/><char style="wj">Aane, Agya, wo pɛ mu na woma ɛbaa saa.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mʼagya no de nneɛma nyinaa ahyɛ me nsa. Obiara nnim Ɔba no gye Agya no nko ara. Na obiara nnim Agya no gye Ɔba no, ne wɔn a Ɔba no pɛ sɛ ɔda no adi kyerɛ wɔn.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo a moayɛ adwuma abrɛ na moasoa nnesoa nyinaa, mommra me nkyɛn, na mɛma mo ahome.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/><char style="wj">Momfa me kɔnnua nto mo ho so, na monsua me, ɛfiri sɛ, medwo, na mebrɛ me ho ase akoma mu, na mobɛnya ahome ama mo kra.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, me kɔnnua yɛ mmerɛ, na mʼadesoa yɛ hare.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Homeda Ho Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Homeda bi, Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no kɔfaa aburoofuo bi mu. Wɔnam aburoofuo no mu no, ɛkɔm dee asuafoɔ no ma wɔpempanee aburoo no bi weeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Farisifoɔ bi hunuu deɛ asuafoɔ no reyɛ no, anyɛ wɔn abodwo. Wɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Woahunu sɛ wʼasuafoɔ no abu Homeda mmara no so?”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkenkanee deɛ Ɔhene Dawid yɛeɛ, ɛberɛ a ɛkɔm dee ɔne wɔn a na wɔka ne ho no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/><char style="wj">Wɔkɔɔ Onyankopɔn fie kɔdii burodo a wɔde abɔ afɔdeɛ a anka wɔnni ho kwan sɛ wɔdi, agye ɔsɔfoɔ nko ara no. Ɛno nso yɛ mmara so buo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/><char style="wj">Na monnsane nkane mfirii Mose mmara no mu, sɛ asɔfoɔ a wɔyɛ asɔrefie adwuma no tumi yɛ adwuma Homeda nso?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/><char style="wj">Mereka ama moate aseɛ sɛ, deɛ ɔkyɛn asɔrefie no wɔ ha!</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moate asɛm a ɛse, ‘Mmɔborɔhunu na mepɛ na ɛnyɛ afɔrebɔ’ no ase yie a, anka moremmu wɔn a wɔnni fɔ no fɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/><char style="wj">Na me, Onipa Ba no, meyɛ Homeda no wura”.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu firii deɛ ɔwɔ hɔ kɔɔ hyiadan mu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Ɔhunuu ɔbarima bi wɔ dan mu hɔ a na ne nsa baako awu. Farisifoɔ no bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Enti mmara ma ho kwan sɛ obi sa yadeɛ Homeda anaa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmara akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ mma ayaresa ho kwan homeda; gye sɛ wɔhunu sɛ, sɛ wɔansa ɔyarefoɔ no yadeɛ da no ara na adeɛ kye a, ɔbɛwu. Obi a na ne nsa awu no deɛ na ɛnyɛ deɛ owuo hunahuna noɔ.</char></note> Wɔbisaa yei sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛnya ɛkwan atoto nʼano na wɔakye no!<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mu hwan na ɔwɔ odwan baako na sɛ ɔkɔtɔ amena mu Homeda a, ɔrenyi no? Ɛkwan biara so wobɛkɔ akɔyi no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/><char style="wj">Onipa som bo sene odwan! Yei enti ɛwɔ ho kwan sɛ wɔyɛ papa Homeda.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ deɛ ne nsa awu no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Tene wo nsa!”</char> Ɔyarefoɔ no tenee ne nsa. Ɔtenee ne nsa no, ahoɔden baa mu ma ɛyɛɛ sɛ baako no. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Farisifoɔ no firii adi kɔtuu sɛdeɛ wɔbɛkyere Yesu akum no no ho agyina.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Esiane sɛ na ɔnim ɛpɔ a wɔrebɔ wɔ ne ho no enti, ɔfirii hyiadan no mu maa nnipadɔm dii nʼakyi. Ɔsaa wɔn mu ayarefoɔ no nyinaa yadeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Nanso, ɔbɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ wɔmmmɔ nʼanwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛeɛ no ho dawuro. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Na nkɔm a Odiyifoɔ Yesaia hyɛɛ no aba mu sɛ:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Monhwɛ mʼakoa a mayi no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">deɛ medɔ no a me kra ani sɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">mede me honhom mɛgu no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">na wabu amanaman atɛn.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Ɔrenko, na ɔrenteateam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Na obi rente ne nne abɔntene so!<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Ɔrensɛe demmire ɛyɛ mmerɛ no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Kanea ntoma a ɛnnɛre yie no, ɔrennum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">kɔsi sɛ ɔnam atɛntenenee so de nkonimdie aba.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Ne din bɛyɛ amanaman nyinaa anidasoɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisifoɔ Ka Sɛ Yesu Yɛ Ɔbonsam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Afei, wɔde obi a ɔyɛ mumu yɛ onifirani na honhommɔne nso wɔ ne so brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnsa no yadeɛ. Yesu saa no yadeɛ ma ɔkasaeɛ sane hunuu adeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔwɔ hɔ no ho dwirii wɔn. Wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɛbɛtumi aba sɛ Yesu yi yɛ Dawid Ba no, Agyenkwa no anaa?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Nanso, Farisifoɔ no tee anwanwadeɛ a Yesu yɛeɛ no, wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɔnam ahonhommɔne nyinaa panin Ɔbonsam, Beelsebul no so na ɔtu ahonhommɔne.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwene, maa wɔn mmuaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ahemman biara a ɛdi mpaapaemu no ntumi nnyina. Saa ara nso na kuro anaa efie biara a ɛdi mpaapaemu no ntumi nnyina.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔbonsam nso ko tia ne ho a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na nʼahennie agyina?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ menam Beelsebul tumi so na metu ahonhommɔne a, hwan so na mo nkurɔfoɔ nam tu ahonhommɔne? Saa na ɛteɛ de a, mo nkurɔfoɔ no ara na wɔbɛbu mo atɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mede Onyankopɔn honhom na ɛtu ahonhommɔne deɛ a, na Onyankopɔn Ahennie aba mo so.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obi ntumi nkɔ ɔhoɔdenfoɔ fie mu nkɔwia no, agye sɛ, onipa ko no di ɛkan de ahoma kyekyere no.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔnni mʼafa no, tia me. Na deɛ ɔne me mmoaboa ano no hwete mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, wɔde bɔne ne abususɛm nyinaa bɛkyɛ nnipa, nanso abususɛm a ɛtia Honhom Kronkron no deɛ, wɔremfa nkyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔbɛkasa atia Onipa Ba no, wɔde bɛkyɛ no. Nanso, deɛ ɔbɛkasa atia Honhom Kronkron no deɛ, wɔremfa nkyɛ no da biara da.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dua Ne Nʼaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Dua biara aba na wɔde hunu ne su. Dua pa so aba pa na dua bɔne nso so aba bɔne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/><char style="wj">Awɔ mma! Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na abɔnefoɔ sɛ mo atumi aka deɛ ɛyɛ ho asɛm? Deɛ ayɛ akoma ma abu so no na ano ka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/><char style="wj">Onipa pa anom asɛm da nnepa a ɛwɔ ne mu no adi. Saa ara na onipa bɔne nso anom asɛm da nnebɔne a ɛwɔ ne mu no adi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/><char style="wj">Mereka makyerɛ mo sɛ, Atemmuo da no, asɛnhunu biara a obi aka no, ɔbɛbu ho akonta.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/><char style="wj">Wʼanomu asɛm so na wɔnam bɛbu wo bem anaa ɛfɔ”.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔpɛ Sɛ Yesu Yɛ Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Ɛda bi, Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ bi a Farisifoɔ bi ka wɔn ho baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ɔnyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi nkyerɛ wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔman a wɔyɛ abɔnefoɔ a wɔnni gyidie na wɔpɛ sɛ wɔhunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ. Nanso, wɔrenhunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ biara ka Odiyifoɔ Yona deɛ no ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/><char style="wj">Na sɛdeɛ Yona kɔdii bonsu yam nnansa no, saa ara na ɛsɛ sɛ Onipa Ba no kɔdi asase mu nnansa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, Ninewe mmarima bɛsɔre atia nnɛmma yi na wɔabu mo fɔ ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ a Yona kaa asɛmpa no, wɔnuu wɔn ho. Nanso, deɛ ɔsene Yona wɔ ha.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, Seba Ɔhemmaa bɛsɔre atia ɔman yi ɛfiri sɛ, ɔfiri asase ano nohoa bɛtiee Salomo nyansa nsɛm. Nanso, deɛ ɔsene Salomo no wɔ ha.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ɔman debɔneyɛfoɔ yi te sɛ obi a honhommɔne wɔ ne soɔ. Sɛ honhommɔne no tu firi ne mu a, ɛkyinkyini, hwehwɛ homebea nanso, ɛnnya bi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɛba saa a, deɛ honhommɔne no ka ne sɛ, ‘Mɛsane akɔ onipa a mefirii ne mu baeɛ no mu bio.’ Ɔsane kɔ onipa no mu na ɔhunu sɛ ne mu da mpan, na wɔasiesie hɔ fɛfɛɛfɛ a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/><char style="wj">ɔsane nʼakyi kɔfa ahonhommɔne afoforɔ nson a wɔyɛ den kyɛn no ba ma wɔn nyinaa bɛtena ne mu. Yei ma onipa no asetena no sɛe kyɛn ne kane asetena no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Ne Maame Ne Ne Nuanom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu reka asɛmpa akyerɛ nnipadɔm wɔ efie bi mu no, ne maame ne ne nuanom bɛgyinaa afikyire pɛɛ sɛ wɔne no kasa. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu baako kɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Wo maame ne wo nuanom gyina afikyire hɔ pɛ sɛ wɔne wo kasa”.<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwan ne me maame? Ɛhefoɔ ne me nuanom?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Ɔkaa saa wieeɛ no, ɔde ne nsa kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no, ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yeinom ne me maame ne me nuanom”.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Ɔsane kaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔbɛyɛ mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no apɛdeɛ no, ɔno ne me nuabarima, ne me nuabaa ne me maame”.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuafoɔ Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Ɛda no ara Yesu firii adi kɔtenaa mpoano. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Nnipakuo kɔɔ ne nkyɛn wɔ hɔ. Ɔkɔtenaa kodoɔ bi mu a na nnipakuo no nso gyinagyina mpoano hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn abɛbuo mu sɛ, <char style="wj">“Okuafoɔ bi kɔɔ nʼafuom kɔguu aba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/><char style="wj">Ɔgu so reguo no, aba no bi guu ɛkwan mu maa nnomaa bɛsosɔɔ ne nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/><char style="wj">Ebi nso kɔguu abotan so. Ankyɛre na aba no fifiriiɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ na dɔteɛ a ɛwɔ abotan no so sua no enti, owia bɔɔ so no, ne nyinaa hyeeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso guu nkasɛɛ mu, na nkasɛɛ no nyiniiɛ no ɛmiaa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi guu asase pa mu. Ɛnyiniiɛ, soo aba mmɔho aduasa; ebi aduosia ɛnna afoforɔ nso ɔha.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no, ma ɔntie!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deɛ Enti A Yesu Kasa Abɛbuo Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Ɔwiee ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no, nʼasuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn na daa wonam abɛbuo so kasa kyerɛ nnipa no?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo deɛ, wɔde Ɔsoro Ahennie ho ahintasɛm ama mo na wɔn deɛ, wɔmmfa mmaa wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ biribi no, wɔbɛma no bi aka ho na wanya ma abu ne so. Na deɛ ɔnni ahe bi no, kakra a ɔwɔ no mpo, wɔbɛgye afiri ne nsam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/><char style="wj">Deɛ enti a ɛma mekasa kyerɛ wɔn abɛbuo mu no ne sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">
    <char style="wj">“Wɔhunu deɛ, nanso wɔnhunu;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">
    <char style="wj">wɔte deɛ, na wɔnte aseɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Yei maa Yesaia nkɔm a ɔhyɛɛ sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɔte deɛ mobɛte, nanso morente aseɛ;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">ɔhunu deɛ mobɛhunu, nanso morenhunu no, aba mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔman yi akoma apirim.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">Wɔyɛ asoɔden;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">wɔakatakata wɔn ani.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">Sɛ ɛnte saa a anka wɔn ani bɛhunu adeɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn aso ate asɛm,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn akoma ate asɛm ase,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">na wɔanu wɔn ho asane aba me nkyɛn na masa wɔn yadeɛ.’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Na mo deɛ, wɔahyira mo ani sɛ ɛnhunu adeɛ; wɔahyira mo aso sɛ ɛnte asɛm.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/><char style="wj">Na me deɛ mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, adiyifoɔ ne ateneneefoɔ pii pɛɛ sɛ wɔhunu deɛ mohunu no, nanso wɔanhunu. Wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔte deɛ mote no, nanso wɔante.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuafoɔ Ho Ɛbɛ No Asekyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, montie ɛbɛ a ɛfa okuafoɔ a ɔkɔguu aba wɔ nʼafuom no ho no asekyerɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔtie Onyankopɔn asɛm no, na wɔnte aseɛ no te sɛ aba a ɛguu ɛkwan mu no. Ɔbɔnefoɔ no ba, bɛhwim deɛ wɔadua wɔ wɔn akoma mu no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu abotan soɔ no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte asɛm no, na wɔde anigyeɛ sɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/><char style="wj">Nanso, asɛm no ntim wɔ wɔn mu. Yei enti, ɛnkyɛre na asɛm no awu. Esiane sɛ asɛm no awuo enti, sɛ ɔhaw anaa ɔtaa bi ba a, wɔpa aba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu nkasɛɛ mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔtie asɛm no, nanso ewiase yi mu abrabɔ mu haw ne agyapadeɛ ho dwene enti, ɛmma asɛm no ntumi nnyɛ wɔn mu adwuma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/><char style="wj">Na aba a ɛguu asase pa mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔtie asɛm no, na wɔte aseɛ. Wɔso aba mmɔho aduasa; ebi aduosia; ɛnna afoforɔ nso, ɔha.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewira Ne Aburoo Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu de ɛbɛ foforɔ kaa asɛm sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie no te sɛ okuafoɔ bi a ɔdua aba wɔ nʼafuom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/><char style="wj">Ɛda koro anadwo a wada no, ne ɔtamfoɔ nso bɛduaa wira fraa aburoo a wadua no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/><char style="wj">Aburoo no renyini no, na wira no nso renyini.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Okuafoɔ no apaafoɔ bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Owura, aba a woduaeɛ no, wira bi afifiri wɔ aseɛ!’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Okuafoɔ no buaa sɛ, ‘Ɔtamfoɔ bi na ɔduaeɛ!’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">
    <char style="wj">“Apaafoɔ no bisaa no sɛ, ‘Wopɛ sɛ yɛkɔtutu saa wira no anaa?’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, ‘Dabi! Anhwɛ a na moatutu aburoo no bi afra wira no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/><char style="wj">Momma ne nyinaa nyini nkɔsi otwa berɛ na mama atwafoɔ ayiyi wira no afiri aburoo no mu ahye no, na wɔde aburoo no nso agu asan so.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyina Aba Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu buu wɔn ɛbɛ foforɔ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie te sɛ onyina aba ketewa bi a obi duaa wɔ nʼafuom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/><char style="wj">Ɛyɛ aba ketewaa bi, nanso sɛ ɛnyini a, ɛyɛ dutan kɛseɛ ma nnomaa kɔsisi ne mman so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmɔka Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Ɔbuu wɔn ɛbɛ foforɔ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie te sɛ mmɔreka bi a burodotofoɔ de fotɔ mmɔre ma ɛtu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu nam abɛbuo so na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Esiane sɛ na adiyifoɔ ahyɛ nkɔm sɛ ɔnam abɛbuo so bɛkasa enti, wanka asɛm a wamfa abɛbuo amfra mu. Nkɔm a adiyifoɔ no hyɛeɛ ne sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Mɛkasa abɛbuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">na maka anwanwadeɛ mu ahintasɛm a ɛfiri adebɔ mfitiaseɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewira Ne Aburoo Ho Ɛbɛ No Asekyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Afei, Yesu firii nnipadɔm no nkyɛn kɔɔ efie. Nʼasuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ɔnkyerɛ wɔn abɛbuo a ɛfa ewira ne aba ho no ase.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me Onipa Ba no, mene okuafoɔ a ɔduaa aba no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/><char style="wj">Afuo no ne ewiase, na aba no nso gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔyɛ Ahennie no mma; ewira no nso gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔyɛ ɔbonsam mma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/><char style="wj">Ɔtamfoɔ a ɔduaa ewira fraa aburoo no ne ɔbɔnefoɔ no. Otwa berɛ no yɛ ewiase awieeɛ; atwafoɔ no ne abɔfoɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛdeɛ asɛnka no mu, wɔtutuu wira no firi aburoo no mu kɔhyee no no, saa ara na ɛbɛyɛ ewiase awieeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no bɛsoma nʼabɔfoɔ, na wɔabɛboaboa wɔn a wɔpɛ bɔne, nsɛmmɔnedifoɔ nyinaa ano afiri Ahennie no mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/><char style="wj">na wɔato wɔn agu ogyatannaa no mu, ahye wɔn. Ɛhɔ na esu ne agyaadwoɔ wɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/><char style="wj">Na ateneneefoɔ no bɛhyerɛn sɛ owia wɔ wɔn Agya Ahennie no mu. Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no, ma ɔntie!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ademudeɛ Ne Ahwene Pa Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>Yesu toaa abɛbuo no so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie no te sɛ ademudeɛ bi a obi kɔhunuu wɔ afuo bi mu.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tete no, ɛsiane sɛ na sikakorabea biara nni baabi enti, na wɔde ademudeɛ sie fam.</char></note> <char style="wj">Ɔkataa so, na ɔde ahopere kɔtɔn nʼahodeɛ nyinaa, de kɔtɔɔ afuo no.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bio, Ɔsoro Ahennie te sɛ obi a ɔdi ahwene pa ho edwa a ɔrepɛ ahwene pa atɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/><char style="wj">Ɔkɔnyaa bi a ɛyɛ fɛ mmoroso, enti ɔkɔtɔn nʼahodeɛ nyinaa de kɔtɔeɛ!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asauguo Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>Yesu toaa so bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie no te sɛ obi a ɔkɔguu asau wɔ asuo bi mu yii nsuomnam ahodoɔ bebree.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/><char style="wj">Asau no yɛɛ ma no, ɔtwe baa konkɔn so. Afei, ɔtenaa ase yiyii nam pa no guu kɛntɛn mu ɛnna ɔtoo deɛ ɛnyɛ no guiɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na ewiase awieeɛ bɛyɛ. Abɔfoɔ no bɛba abɛpa abɔnefoɔ no afiri ateneneefoɔ no mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/><char style="wj">na wɔato abɔnefoɔ no agu ogyatannaa no mu; ɛhɔ na esu ne agyaadwoɔ wɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mote aseɛ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Nʼasuafoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “Aane.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesu toaa ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a wɔabɛyɛ mʼasuafoɔ no te sɛ efiewura a wada nʼagyapadeɛ foforɔ ne dada nyinaa adi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔpo Yesu Wɔ Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu wiee nʼabɛbuo no, ɔfiri baabi a ɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>Ɔkɔɔ ne kurom Nasaret. Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ hyiadan mu maa wɔn a wɔtiee no no ho dwirii wɔn. Wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Ɛhe na saa ɔbarima yi kɔnyaa nyansa a ɔde yɛ anwanwadeɛ sɛɛ yi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Ɛnyɛ dua dwumfoɔ no ba no ni? Ɛnyɛ ne maame ne Maria? Ɛnyɛ ne nua mmarimanom ne Yakobo ne Yosef ne Simon ne Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Ɛnyɛ yɛne ne nuammaanom na ɛte ha? Na afei ɛhe na ɔkɔnyaa yeinom nyinaa yi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Wɔn bo fuu no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Odiyifoɔ wɔ animuonyam baabiara, agye ne ɔman mu anaa ne nkurɔfoɔ mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Esiane sɛ wɔannye no annie no enti, wanyɛ anwanwadeɛ bebree wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni Kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Ɛberɛ no mu ara na Herode a na ɔdi ɔhene wɔ Galilea no tee Yesu nka. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Ɔtee Yesu nka no, deɛ ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ ne sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ obiara sɛ Yohane Osubɔni na wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu. Yei enti na wanya tumi foforɔ de reyɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ yi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Herode ama wɔakyere Yohane Osubɔni ato afiase, ɛfiri sɛ, na wakasa atia Herodia ne Herode awadeɛ no <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>sɛ, Herode aware ne nua Filipo yere. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Herode pɛɛ sɛ ɔkum Yohane. Nanso na ɔsuro sɛ, sɛ ɔkum no a, basabasa bɛba ɔman no mu. Ɛfiri sɛ, na nnipa no nyinaa bu Yohane sɛ odiyifoɔ.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Ɛbaa sɛ na Herode redi nʼawoda. Awoda no ase Herodia babaa bɛsa ma ɛyɛɛ Herode fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Yei maa Herode kaa ntam, hyɛɛ no bɔ sɛ, ɔmmisa deɛ ɔpɛ biara na ɔde bɛma no. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Ababaawa yi maame Herodia tuu no fo sɛ, “Mmisa biribiara, gye sɛ Yohane ti a wɔatwa ato prɛte mu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Herode tee asɛm yi no, ɛyɛɛ no ya, ma ɛhaa no. Nanso, ɛsiane ntam a waka wɔ nnipa a wɔahyia hɔ no anim no enti, ɔhyɛ ma wɔyɛɛ deɛ ababaawa no hwehwɛ no maa no. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Herode soma ma wɔkɔtwaa Yohane ti wɔ afiase hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Wɔde ti a wɔatwa no too prɛte mu de brɛɛ ababaawa no maa ɔde kɔmaa ne maame. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Yohane asuafoɔ no bɛfaa nʼamu no kɔsiee no. Yei akyi, wɔkɔbɔɔ Yohane wuo no ho amaneɛ kyerɛɛ Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nnipa Mpemnum Aduane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu tee Yohane Osubɔni wuo no, ɔtee ne ho kɔtenaa baabi a obiara nni hɔ. Nnipa tee ne nka maa wɔnam fam firi wɔn nkuro ne wɔn nkuraaseɛ tii no kɔɔ deɛ ɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesu firii kodoɔ no mu baa deɛ nnipa no wɔ hɔ no. Ɔhunuu nnipadɔm no, ne yam hyehyee no maa wɔn. Yei ma ɔsaa ayarefoɔ a wɔwɔ wɔn mu no yadeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Anim rebiribiri no, Yesu asuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Adeɛ asa awie. Aduane biara nso nni ha. Ɛha nso mmɛn kuro biara. Enti gya nnipa no kwan, na wɔnkɔhwehwɛ aduane ntɔ nni wɔ nkuro no bi so.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛho nhia sɛ wɔkɔ; momma wɔn aduane nni!”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Asuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Deɛ yɛwɔ nyinaa yɛ burodo enum ne mpataa mmienu pɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momfa mmrɛ me.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no ma wɔtenatenaa ase wɔ ɛserɛ no so. Ɔhwɛɛ ɔsoro bɔɔ mpaeɛ, hyiraa aduane no so. Afei, ɔbubuu mu de maa nʼasuafoɔ no ma wɔkyekyɛ maa nnipadɔm no. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Nnipa no dii aduane no maa obiara meeɛ! Afei, asuafoɔ no boaboaa deɛ wɔdi ma ɛkaeɛ no ano no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛmma dumienu. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Mmarima a wɔdii aduane no dodoɔ bɛyɛ mpemnum a mmaa ne mmɔfra nka ho.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nante Nsuo Ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Nnipadɔm no didi wieeɛ pɛ, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, wɔntena kodoɔ no mu nni ɛkan ntwa nkɔ asuogya nohoa na ɔno deɛ, ɔretena hɔ agya nnipa no kwan. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Ɔgyaa wɔn ɛkwan wieeɛ no, ɔkɔɔ bepɔ bi so kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ. Onwunu dwoeɛ no, na aka Yesu nko ara wɔ deɛ ɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na kodoɔ a na asuafoɔ no te mu no aduru akyiri. Mframa hyɛɛ aseɛ bɔɔ denden maa ɛpo no bɔɔ asorɔkye dweradweraa kodoɔ no a na asuafoɔ no te mu no.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Anɔpahema bɛyɛ nnɔnnan berɛ mu no, Yesu nam ɛpo no ani baa asuafoɔ no nkyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Ɛberɛ a asuafoɔ no hunuu obi sɛ ɔnam nsuo no ani reba wɔn nkyɛn no wɔsuroeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔsusu sɛ wɔahunu ɔsaman. Ɛmaa wɔde ehu teateaam.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Ntɛm ara, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me a. Monnsuro. Momma mo bo ntɔ mo yam!”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Awurade, sɛ ɛyɛ wo deɛ a, ka kyerɛ me, na me nso memfa nsuo no ani mmra wo nkyɛn.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Bra!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Petro firii kodoɔ no mu sii nsuo no ani, nantee sɛ ɔrekɔ Yesu nkyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Nanso, ɔhunuu mframa a ɛrebɔ no, ne ho popoeɛ. Ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ sɛ ɔremem. Ɔteateaam, frɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, gye me na meremem!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Yesu tenee ne nsa twee no. Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo a wo gyidie sua, adɛn na wonnye me nnie?”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Yesu ne Petro kɔtenaa kodoɔ no mu no, mframa no gyaee bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Asuafoɔ a wɔwɔ kodoɔ no mu no de ahodwirie bɛkotoo Yesu kaa sɛ, “Onyankopɔn Ba ne wo ampa!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Genesaret Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Wɔtwaa asuo no baa Genesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Yesu duruu hɔ no, ankyɛre na nkuro a atwa Genesaret ho ahyia no nyinaa tee ne nka. Wɔde wɔn ayarefoɔ nyinaa brɛɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Ayarefoɔ no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ, ɔmma wɔmfa wɔn nsa nka nʼatadeɛ ano kɛkɛ. Ayarefoɔ dodoɔ a wɔtumi de wɔn nsa kaa nʼatadeɛ ano no ho yɛɛ wɔn den.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahoteɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Ɛda bi, Farisifoɔ ne Yudafoɔ mpanin no bi firi Yerusalem baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Adɛn enti na wʼasuafoɔ no nni Yudafoɔ amanneɛ so? Yɛn amanneɛ a yɛhohoro yɛn nsa ho ansa na yɛadidi no, wɔnni so.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na mo nso mode mo amanneɛ no bu Onyankopɔn mmaransɛm so?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/><char style="wj">Ebi ne sɛ, Onyankopɔn mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Di wʼagya ne wo maame ni,’ na baako nso ne sɛ, ‘Obiara a ɔbɛka asɛmmɔne afa nʼawofoɔ ho no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum no,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/><char style="wj">Na mo deɛ, deɛ moka ne sɛ, sɛ obi ka kyerɛ ne maame anaa nʼagya sɛ, ‘Mewɔ adeɛ bi a anka mɛtumi de aboa mo, nanso mede rekɔma Onyankopɔn’ a, ɛnyɛ bɔne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/><char style="wj">Enti, mo ara monam mo mmara a moahyɛ so bu Onyankopɔn mmara a ɔhyɛɛ sɛ di wʼagya ne wo maame ni no so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/><char style="wj">Mo nyaatwomfoɔ! Sɛ Yesaia hyɛɛ mo ho nkɔm sɛ:</char><verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Saa nnipa yi ka sɛ wɔdi me ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="wj">nanso wɔn akoma mmɛn me.</char><verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Wɔsom me ani so kɛkɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, wɔkyerɛkyerɛ mmara a onipa ayɛ na ɛnyɛ deɛ ɛfiri Onyankopɔn.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Afei, Yesu frɛɛ nnipadɔm no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Montie deɛ meka no na mommɔ mmɔden nte aseɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/><char style="wj">Ɛnyɛ adeɛ a ɛbɛkɔ onipa mu no na ɛmma ne ho nte, na mmom, deɛ ɛbɛfiri ne mu aba no na ɛgu ne ho fi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Nsɛm a Yesu kaeɛ yi maa nʼasuafoɔ no ba bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wonim sɛ wo nsɛm a wokaeɛ no ama Farisifoɔ no bo afu?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Dua biara a ɛnyɛ mʼagya na ɔduaeɛ no, wɔbɛtu atwene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/><char style="wj">Mommmua wɔn koraa! Na wɔyɛ anifirafoɔ a wɔrekyerɛ anifirafoɔ ɛkwan enti wɔn nyinaa bɛkɔ akɔte ahwe amena mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Kyerɛ yɛn ɛbɛ no ase.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu nso bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ampa ara sɛ monte aseɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/><char style="wj">Monnim sɛ adeɛ a ɛfa onipa anom no fa onipadua no mu na asane aba bio?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a ɛho nteɛ biara firi akoma a emu nteɛ mu ma ɛgu deɛ ɔkaa saa asɛm no ho fi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/><char style="wj">Akoma mu na adwemmɔne, awudie, ayerefasɛm, adwamammɔ, korɔno, atorɔ ne ntwatosoɔ firi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/><char style="wj">Yeinom na ɛgu onipa ho fi. Nanso, sɛ obi anhohoro ne nsa sɛdeɛ mo amanneɛ teɛ no na ɔdidi a, ne ho nguu fi honhom mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa Bi Gyidie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu firii ɔman no mu hɔ kɔɔ Tiro ne Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Kanaanni baa bi a ɔte ɔman no mu hɔ de su baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, “Awurade, Dawid Ba, hunu me mmɔbɔ! Honhommɔne hyɛ me ba mu na sɛ ɛka ne ho a, ɛma ne ho yera no.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Yesu anka hwee. Nʼasuafoɔ no hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔmpam ɔbaa no mfiri hɔ. Wɔtii mu ka kyerɛɛ no bio sɛ, “Ka kyerɛ no na ɔmfiri ha nkɔ, na ɔde nʼadesrɛ no retuatua yɛn aso.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔsomaa me sɛ memmɛboa Yudafoɔ, Israel nnwan a wɔayera no, na ɛnyɛ amanamanmufoɔ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Ɔba bɛkotoo no kɔɔ so srɛɛ no sɛ, “Me wura, boa me!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ sɛ wɔbɛgye burodo afiri mmɔfra nsam ato ama nkraman.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Ɔbaa no nso buaa sɛ, “Ɛwom saa deɛ, nanso nkraman no nso tumi di mporoporowa a ɛfiri wɔn wura no ɛpono so gu fam no.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbaa, wo gyidie mu yɛ den. Mɛyɛ wʼabisadeɛ ama wo.”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, ne babaa no ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa Ahodoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu sane baa Galilea ɛpo no ho. Ɔforo kɔtenaa bepɔ bi so. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Nnipa bebree de mpakye, anifirafoɔ, apirafoɔ, mumu ɛnna wɔn a wɔyare nyarewa ahodoɔ baa ne nkyɛn sɛ ɔnsa wɔn yadeɛ, ma ɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yadeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Anwanwasɛm ni! Wɔn a wɔnkasaa da kasaeɛ; mpakye nyaa ahoɔden; na mmubuafoɔ nanteeɛ, hurihuriiɛ na anifirafoɔ hunuu adeɛ. Nnipadɔm no ho dwirii wɔn ma wɔkamfoo Israel Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa Mpemnan Aduanema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Afei Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no nyinaa baa ne nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa yi yɛ me mmɔbɔ. Wɔabɛdi me nkyɛn ha nnansa. Aduane a ɛwɔ ha nyinaa nso asa. Nanso mempɛ sɛ mema wɔkɔ wɔn afie mu a wɔnnidiiɛ, anyɛ saa a, wɔbɛtotɔ bera wɔ ɛkwan so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Nʼasuafoɔ no nso bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛserɛ so ha deɛ, ɛhe na yɛbɛnya nnipadɔm yi ano aduane?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Burodo dodoɔ bɛn na mowɔ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Yɛwɔ burodo nson ne mpataa kakraa bi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no maa wɔn nyinaa tenatenaa ase wɔ ɛserɛ no so. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Afei ɔfaa burodo nson no ne mpataa no, hyiraa so na ɔbubuu mu de maa asuafoɔ no sɛ wɔmfa mma nnipadɔm no nni. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Wɔn nyinaa dii aduane no mee pintinn. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Wɔn a wɔdii saa aduane no, na wɔn dodoɔ yɛ nnipa mpemnan a wɔankan mmaa ne mmɔfra anka ho. Wɔdidi wieeɛ no, akyire mporoporowa a wɔtaseeɛ no yɛɛ nkɛntɛmma nson. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Yei akyi, Yesu gyaa nkurɔfoɔ no kwan, ma ɔno nso kɔtenaa kodoɔ mu tware kɔɔ Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Farisifoɔ Ne Sadukifoɔ Pɛ Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Ɛda koro bi, Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛsɔɔ no hwɛeɛ wɔ frɛ a ɔfrɛ ne ho sɛ Onyankopɔn Ba no ho. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi a ɛfiri ɔsoro nkyerɛ wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monim ewiem nsakraeɛ ho nkyerɛaseɛ. Sɛ owia rekɔtɔ, na ewiem yɛ kɔkɔɔ a, moka sɛ ɔkyena ewiem bɛte.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɛduru anɔpa na ewiem yɛ kɔkɔɔ a, moka sɛ ewiem rente da mu no nyinaa. Nanso, montumi nkyerɛ mmerɛ mu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/><char style="wj">Saa ɔman nnebɔneyɛfoɔ a wɔnnye hwee nni yi hwehwɛ sɛ wɔbɛhunu ɛsoro nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi, nanso wɔrenhunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ foforɔ biara ka anwanwadeɛ a wɔyi kyerɛɛ Yona no ho.”</char> Yesu kaa saa wieeɛ no, ɔgyaa wɔn hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisifoɔ Ne Sadukifoɔ Mmɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Asuafoɔ no tware kɔɔ asuogya nohoa no, wɔkaee sɛ anka ɛsɛ sɛ wɔfa aduane. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yie wɔ Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ nyaatwom a ɛte sɛ mmɔreka no ho.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Asuafoɔ no susuu sɛ gyama wɔnkura aduane biara no enti na Yesu kaa saa.<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu hunuu deɛ wɔdwennwene no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo a mo gyidie sua! Adɛn na ɛha mo sɛ moamfa aduane?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/><char style="wj">Enti, morente aseɛ da? Mo werɛ afiri burodo enum a mebubuu mu maa nnipa mpemnum no ne aseɛ mporoporowa nkɛntɛmma a ɛkaeɛ no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/><char style="wj">Mo werɛ asane afiri burodo nson a mede maa nnipa mpemnan ne deɛ ɛkaeɛ no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/><char style="wj">Adɛn enti na modwene sɛ aduane ho asɛm na mereka akyerɛ mo? Meresane aka bio sɛ, ‘Monhwɛ mo ho yie wɔ Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ mmɔreka ho.’ ”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Afei, asuafoɔ no tee deɛ ɔkaeɛ no ase sɛ, Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ mmɔreka ho asɛm a ɔreka akyerɛ no yɛ Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ nkyerɛkyerɛ bɔne bi no ho asɛm na ɔreka.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Kyerɛ Onipa Ko A Yesu Yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu baa Kaesarea Filipi fam no, ɔbisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa ka sɛ Onipa Ba no ne hwan?”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Ebinom se wone Yohane Osubɔni. Ebinom nso se Elia. Afoforɔ nso se wone Yeremia anaa adiyifoɔ no mu baako.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Afei, Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ <char style="wj">“Na mo nso, mose mene hwan?”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Petro buaa no sɛ, “Wone Kristo no, Onyankopɔn Teasefoɔ no Ba no!”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onyankopɔn ahyira wo, Yona ba Simon. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnyɛ onipa na ɔyii yei kyerɛɛ wo, na mmom, mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/><char style="wj">Wone Petro, Ɔbotan, na ɔbotan yi so na mede mʼasafo bɛsie, na tumi a ɛwɔ ɔbonsam gyam no rentumi mmubu no da.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/><char style="wj">Mede Ɔsoro Ahennie no nsafoa bɛma wo, na ɛpono biara a wobɛto mu wɔ asase so no, wɔbɛto mu wɔ ɔsoro; na ɛpono biara a wobɛbue wɔ asase so no, wɔbɛbue wɔ ɔsoro!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Afei, Yesu bɔɔ nʼasuafoɔ no ano sɛ wɔnnka nkyerɛ obiara sɛ ɔno ne Agyenkwa no.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Owuo Ne Ne Owusɔreɛ Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, Yesu hyɛɛ aseɛ kaa kɔ a ɔbɛkɔ Yerusalem, ne amaneɛ a ɛbɛto no wɔ hɔ wɔ Yudafoɔ mpanin, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne twerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no nsam na wɔakum no, na nnansa so no wanyane no ho asɛm pefee kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Petro frɛɛ Yesu kɔɔ nkyɛn na ɔkaa nʼanim sɛ, “Adɛn enti na woka asɛm a ɛte saa! Onyame mpa ngu! Deɛ woreka yi remma wo so da!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Yesu danee ne ho kaa Petro anim sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbonsam, firi me so! Woyɛ suntidua kɛseɛ ma me. Wodwene nnipa adwene na ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn deɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔdi mʼakyi a, ɔmpa ne ho akyi, na ɔmma nʼasɛnnua so, na ɔnni mʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔgye ne ɔkra nkwa no, ɛbɛfiri ne nsa, na obiara a me enti, ne ɔkra bɛfiri ne nsa no, ne nsa bɛsane aka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ onipa nya ewiase yi mu nneɛma nyinaa na ɔhwere ne ɔkra a, mfasoɔ bɛn na ɔbɛnya? Ɛdeɛn na onipa bɛtumi de asi ne ɔkra ananmu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/><char style="wj">Na me, Onipa Ba no, mɛba wɔ mʼagya animuonyam mu a mʼabɔfoɔ ka me ho na mabɛbu obiara nneyɛeɛ ho atɛn.</char><verse eid="MAT 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nokorɛ mese mo sɛ: Mo mu bi renwu kɔsi sɛ mobɛhunu Onipa Ba no sɛ ɔreba nʼahennie mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Animuonyam Da Adi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Nnansia akyi, Yesu faa Petro, Yakobo ne ne nua Yohane de wɔn kɔɔ bepɔ tenten bi a ɛso yɛ dinn atifi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Wɔwɔ hɔ no, wɔhunuu sɛ ne onipadua asesa ama nʼanim ahyerɛn sɛ owia, ma nʼatadeɛ ayɛ fitafita sɛ nwera. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Prɛko pɛ, Mose ne Elia bɛfirii hɔ a wɔne Yesu rekasa.<verse eid="MAT 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Petro kaa sɛ, “Awurade, ɛyɛ nwanwa sɛ yɛn nso yɛwɔ ha bi. Sɛ wobɛpene so a, anka mɛbɔ asese mmiɛnsa na mede baako ama wo, na mede baako ama Mose, na mede baako ama Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Petro gu so rekasa no, omununkum hann bi bɛkataa wɔn so ɛnna nne bi firi omununkum no mu kaa sɛ, “Yei ne me Dɔ Ba a ɔsɔ mʼani. Montie no!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Asuafoɔ no tee nne no, wɔbɔɔ hu, maa wɔde wɔn anim butubutuu fam. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yesu baa wɔn nkyɛn, bɛsosɔɔ wɔn mu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monsɔre! Monnsuro!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Wɔpagyaa wɔn ani nso, wɔanhunu obiara sɛ Yesu nko ara.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Ɛbaa sɛ wɔresiane afiri bepɔ no so no, Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnka deɛ moahunu no nkyerɛ obiara kɔsi sɛ mɛnyane afiri awufoɔ mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elia Mmaeɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Yesu asuafoɔ no bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na da biara Yudafoɔ mpanin ka ti mu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Elia sane ba ansa na Agyenkwa no aba?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ wɔreka no wom. Ɛsɛ sɛ Elia di ɛkan ba bɛtoto nneɛma yie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/><char style="wj">Na nokorɛ ni, Elia aba dada na wɔanhunu no, na dodoɔ no ara ne no anni no yie. Na me, Agyenkwa no nso, mɛhunu amane wɔ wɔn nsam saa ara.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Afei, asuafoɔ no hunuu sɛ, Yohane Osubɔni ho asɛm na ɔreka no.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otwafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔsiane duruu bepɔ no ase no, ɔhunuu sɛ nnipadɔm retwɛn no. Ɔbarima bi bɛbuu nkotodwe wɔ Yesu anim kaa sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>“Owura, hunu me ba bi a ɔtwa mmɔbɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔwɔ ɔhaw kɛseɛ mu. Sɛ otwa no ba a, ɛtumi twa no hwe ogya anaa nsuo mu. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Enti, mede no brɛɛ wʼasuafoɔ no sɛ wɔnsa no yadeɛ; nanso wɔantumi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo asoɔdenfoɔ a monni gyidie! Me ne mo ntena nkɔsi da bɛn? Momfa no mmrɛ me ha.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu teateaa honhommɔne a ɛwɔ abarimaa no mu no ma ɛtu firii ne mu ma amonom hɔ ara ne ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyidie Mu Tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Ɛkaa Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na yɛantumi antu honhommɔne no?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛfiri sɛ, mo gyidie sua. Sɛ mowɔ gyidie sɛ onyina aba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛgyina hɔ ma sinapi aba.</char></note> <char style="wj">a ɛsua koraa no a, anka mobɛtumi aka akyerɛ bepɔ yi sɛ, ‘Tutu kɔ nohoa!’ na ɛbɛtutu akɔ akyirikyiri.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/><char style="wj">Na saa honhommɔne a ɛte sɛɛ yi deɛ, ɛrentumi ntu da, gye sɛ monam mpaeɛbɔ ne mmuada die so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ka Ne Owuo Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no wɔ Galilea no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔrebɛyi Onipa Ba no de no ahyɛ wɔn a</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/><char style="wj">wɔwɔ tumi no nsa, na wɔakum no na ne nnansa so no, wanyane aba nkwa mu bio.”</char> Asuafoɔ no tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn werɛ hoeɛ, na wɔn akoma nso tuiɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tua Asɔredan Mu Ɛtoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔbɛduruu Kapernaum no nso, ɛhɔ asɔre no mu ɔtogyefoɔ baa Petro nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Enti, wo wura tua ɛtoɔ?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Petro buaa no sɛ, “Aane ɔtua.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petro firi hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ efie kɔbɔɔ Yesu amaneɛ a ɛfa ɛtoɔtua no ho. Yesu amma nʼano ansi koraa na ɔbisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Na wo Petro, wo nso wodwene ho sɛn? Ahemfo twa ɛtoɔ ma wɔn ara wɔn ɔmanfoɔ tua anaasɛ wɔtwa ma ahɔhoɔ a wɔdi wɔn so no?”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Petro buaa sɛ, “Wɔtwa ɛtoɔ no ma ahɔhoɔ no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu nso buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Petro mo! Ɛnneɛ na ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔman mma no tua ɛtoɔ biara.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/><char style="wj">Na mmom, ɛsiane sɛ mempɛ sɛ wɔfa yɛn ho abufuo no enti, kɔ asuo no mu kɔto darewa. Apataa a wobɛyi no adi ɛkan no, bue nʼanom. Wobɛhunu sika a ɛbɛso me ne wo ɛtoɔ no tua sɛ ɛhyɛ nʼanom; yi na fa kɔtua ma wɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Hwan Ne Ɔkɛseɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Ɛbɛyɛ saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu, Yesu asuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, wɔn mu hwan na ɔbɛyɛ kɛseɛ Ɔsoro Ahennie no mu?<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu frɛɛ abɔfra ketewa bi de no bɛgyinaa wɔn mfimfini. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, gye sɛ motwe mo ho firi mo bɔne ho, na moyɛ sɛ mmɔfra nketewa, na mode mo ho ma Onyankopɔn ansa na mobɛtumi akɔ Ɔsoro Ahennie no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/><char style="wj">Enti, obiara a ɔbɛbrɛ ne ho ase sɛ abɔfra yi no, ɔno na ɔbɛyɛ ɔkɛseɛ koraa Ɔsoro Ahennie mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/><char style="wj">Na mo mu biara a, me enti ɔbɛgye abɔfra ketewa biara te sɛ yei no, wagye me nso aba ne nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, sɛ obi to mmɔfra nketewa a wɔgye me die yi bi suntidua a, ɛyɛ ma no sɛ anka wɔde ɛboɔ duruduru bɛsɛn ne kɔn mu ato no atwene ɛpo mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/><char style="wj">Ewiase nnue wɔ ne suntiduatoɔ ho! Suntiduatoɔ wɔ hɔ deɛ, nanso deɛ ɛnam ne so bɛba no nnue.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/><char style="wj">Enti, sɛ wo nsa anaa wo nan ma woyɛ bɔne a, twa na to twene. Ɛyɛ ma wo sɛ wode dɛm bɛkɔ ɔsoro sene sɛ wɔde wo onipa mu bɛto ogyatannaa mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wʼani ma woyɛ bɔne a, tu na to twene. Ɛyɛ ma wo sɛ wode ani korɔ bɛkɔ ɔsoro sene sɛ wowɔ ani mmienu na wɔde wo bɛto amanehunu egya mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odwan A Wayera No Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yie na moammu saa mmɔfra nketewa yi mu baako koraa animtia. Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, ɔsoro hɔ no, wɔn abɔfoɔ wɔ mʼagya nkyɛn daa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/><char style="wj">Na me, Agyenkwa no, mebaeɛ sɛ merebɛgye wɔn a wɔayera no nkwa.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ onipa bi wɔ nnwan ɔha, na wɔn mu baako kɔkyini na ɔyera a, ɛdeɛn na ɔbɛyɛ? Ɔrennya aduɔkron nkron no hɔ nkɔkyinkyini mmepɔ so ne abɔn mu nhwehwɛ deɛ wayera no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɛba sɛ ɔhunu saa odwan no a, nʼani gye ne ho sene aduɔkron nkron a wɔwɔ efie no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no mpɛ sɛ nketewa yi mu baako bɛyera.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onua Fom Wo A, Wʼasɛdeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wo nua fom wo a, kɔ ne nkyɛn na wo ne no baanu no nka deɛ ɔyɛɛ wo a ɛnyɛ wo dɛ no. Sɛ ɔtie deɛ woka no, na ɔte ne ho ase a, onua ayɛ onua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wantie nso a, sane fa onipa baako anaa baanu ka wo ho kɔ ne nkyɛn, na deɛ ɛbɛsi biara no, nnipa baanu anaa baasa adi ho adanseɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wantie wo a, fa asɛm no kɔma asafo. Na sɛ wodi bem asafo no anim, na ɔnte ne ho ase ara a, asafo no mpam no mfiri wɔn mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, biribiara a mokyekyere wɔ asase so no, wɔakyekyere wɔ ɔsoro, na biribiara a moasane wɔ asase so no, wɔasane wɔ ɔsoro.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Meresane aka akyerɛ mo bio sɛ, sɛ mo mu baanu biara a wɔte asase yi so hwehwɛ biribi na wɔde nokorɛ bisa mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no a, ɔbɛyɛ ama wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ baanu anaa baasa ahyia wɔ me din mu no, na mewɔ wɔn mfimfini.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpaani Tirimuɔdenfoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Petro baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, mpɛn ahe na sɛ me nua fom me a memfa nkyɛ no? Mpɛn nson anaa?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Dabi! Mpɛn aduɔson ahodoɔ nson!</char><verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie no te sɛ ɔhene bi a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔne nʼapaafoɔ bu nkonta.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/><char style="wj">Nkontabuo no mu no, wɔde ɔpaani bi a ɔde no ka sika ɔpepem edu brɛɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ na ɔnni sika a ɔde bɛtua ka no enti, ɔhene no hyɛɛ sɛ wɔntɔn ɔne ne yere ne ne mma ne biribiara a ɔwɔ, na wɔmfa mmɛtua ɛka no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔpaani yi de nʼanim butuu fam, srɛɛ ne wura yi sɛ, ‘Me wura, hunu me mmɔbɔ, na to wo bo ase ma me, na mɛba abɛtua ɛka a mede wo no nyinaa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/><char style="wj">Ɔpaani yi asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no yɛɛ ɔhene no mmɔbɔ, ma ɔgyaa no de ne ka no nyinaa nso kyɛɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ɔpaani yi firi hɔ no, ɔkɔhunuu ne nwurakwaa no mu bi a ɔde no ka sika kakraa bi. Ɔtim no amene sɛ ɔntua no ɛka a ɔde no no wɔ ɛhɔ ara.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na nʼawurakwaa no koto, paa no kyɛw sɛ ɔnto ne bo ase mma no, na ɔbɛtua ka no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso ɔno deɛ, wampene. Ɔmaa wɔde no kɔtoo afiase sɛ gye sɛ watua no ka a ɔde no no nyinaa ansa na ɔbɛma wɔagyaa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/><char style="wj">Ɔkafoɔ yi nnamfo kɔkaa asɛm a asi no nyinaa kyerɛɛ ɔhene no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔhene no teeɛ no, ɔfrɛɛ saa ɔpaani a ɔde ne ho kyɛɛ no no baa nʼanim. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Onipa bɔne ne otirimuɔdenfoɔ! Wosrɛɛ me no, mede ɛka kɛseɛ a wode me no nyinaa kyɛɛ wo;</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/><char style="wj">ɛnsɛ wo sɛ wo nso wohunu wo yɔnko mmɔbɔ sɛdeɛ mehunu wo mmɔbɔ no anaa?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/><char style="wj">Ɔhene no de abufuo maa wɔde ɔpaani yi kɔtoo afiase kaa sɛ, gye sɛ watua ɛka a ɔde no no nyinaa ansa na ɔbɛma wɔayi no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ara na sɛ moamfa mo nuanom mfomsoɔ ankyɛ wɔn a, me ɔsoro Agya nso remfa mo mfomsoɔ nkyɛ mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Awaregyaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu wiee nʼasɛnka no, ɔkɔɔ Galilea. Ɔfiri Galilea no, ɔtwaa Asubɔnten Yordan baa Yudea. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Nnipadɔm tu dii nʼakyi, ma ɔsaa wɔn yadeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Farisifoɔ bi ba bɛbisaa no nsɛm bi pɛɛ sɛ wɔnam wɔn nsɛmmisa no so ma ɔka asɛm bi a ɛde no bɛkɔ sɔhwɛ mu. Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Wopene awaregyaeɛ so anaa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Gyama monkenkan Atwerɛ Kronkron no? Wɔatwerɛ wɔ mu sɛ, ‘Mfitiaseɛ no, Onyankopɔn bɔɔ ɔbarima ne ɔbaa!</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/><char style="wj">Yei enti na ɔbarima bɛgya nʼagya ne ne maame hɔ de ne ho akɔbɔ ne yere ho daa nyinaa no.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn baanu no abɛyɛ ɔhonam korɔ. Enti, deɛ Onyankopɔn aka abom no, ɛnsɛ sɛ onipa tete mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Farisifoɔ no kɔɔ so bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na Mose kaa sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi pɛ sɛ ɔgyaa ne yere a ɔtumi twerɛ no krataa kɛkɛ, de gyaa no?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Esiane sɛ na mo akoma apirim no enti na Mose maa awaregyaeɛ ho kwan, na ɛnyɛ adeɛ a Onyankopɔn hyehyɛeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/><char style="wj">Na mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔbɛgyaa ne yere, a ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔbaa no abɔ adwaman, na ɔbɛsane aware ɔbaa foforɔ no asɛe awadeɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Yesu asuafoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Sɛ saa na ɛte deɛ a, na ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara ware.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ obiara na ɔbɛtumi agye asɛm yi atom, agye wɔn a Onyankopɔn hyɛ wɔn den no nko ara.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/><char style="wj">Nnipa bi wɔ hɔ a wɔnni mmarimayɛ mu ahoɔden firi awoɔ mu, ebinom nso nnipa na wɔyɛɛ wɔn saa; ebinom nso ɔsoro Ahennie no enti, wɔpo awadeɛ. Obiara a ɔbɛtumi no, nni mʼasɛm a maka yi so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyira Mmɔfra Nkumaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Wɔde mmɔfra nkumaa brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔmfa ne nsa ngu wɔn so, na ɔmmɔ mpaeɛ mma wɔn. Nanso, asuafoɔ no kaa wɔn a wɔde mmɔfra no baeɛ no anim.<verse eid="MAT 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma mmɔfra no kwan na wɔmmra me nkyɛn, na monnsi wɔn ɛkwan, na yeinom sei na Ɔsoro Ahennie yɛ wɔn dea.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Na ɔde ne nsa guu wɔn so, hyiraa wɔn ansa na ɔrefiri hɔ akɔ.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aberanteɛ Sikani No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Ɛda bi aberanteɛ bi baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, adepa bɛn na menyɛ na manya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na wobisa me deɛ ɛyɛ papa ho asɛm? Ɔbaako pɛ na ɔyɛ papa. Sɛ wopɛ sɛ wokɔ nkwa mu deɛ a, di mmaransɛm no so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Aberanteɛ no nso bisaa no sɛ, “Mmaransɛm no mu deɛ ɛwɔ he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nni awu. Nsɛe awadeɛ. Mmɔ korɔno. Nni atorɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/><char style="wj">Di wʼagya ne wo maame ni, na dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho!”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Aberanteɛ no nso kaa sɛ, “Medi yeinom nyinaa so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Afei, menyɛ ɛdeɛn?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ wopɛ sɛ woyɛ pɛ a, kɔ na kɔtɔn biribiara a wowɔ, na fa sika a wobɛnya afiri mu no ma ahiafoɔ. Ɛno ansa na wobɛnya ademudeɛ wɔ ɔsoro. Afei bɛdi mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Esiane sɛ na saa aberanteɛ yi wɔ ahonyadeɛ bebree enti, ɔtee saa nsɛm yi no, anyɛ no dɛ maa ɔde awerɛhoɔ firii hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ den ma osikani sɛ ɔbɛkɔ Ɔsoro Ahennie no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/><char style="wj">Meka meti mu bio sɛ, ɛyɛ mmerɛ sɛ yoma bɛwura paneɛ aniwa mu sene sɛ osikani bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu!”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Asuafoɔ no tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn adwenem yɛɛ wɔn nnaa. Wɔbisaa sɛ, “Na ɛnneɛ hwan na ewiase ha wɔbɛgye no nkwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu hwɛɛ wɔn buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onipa fa mu deɛ, ɛyɛ den; na Onyankopɔn fa mu deɛ, ɛyɛ mmerɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahopakyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Petro nso kaa sɛ, “Yɛagya biribiara hɔ abɛdi wʼakyiri; na ɛdeɛn mfasoɔ na yɛbɛnya afiri wʼakyiridie no mu?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me, Agyenkwa no, metena mʼanimuonyam ahennwa no so a, nokorɛm mo mʼasuafoɔ yi nso bɛtena ahennwa dumienu no so na moabu Israel mmusuakuo dumienu no atɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbɛgya ne efie, ne nuammarimanom, ne nuammaanom, nʼagya, ne maame, ne yere, ne mma anaa nʼagyapadeɛ abɛdi mʼakyi no, ɔbɛnya no ɛho mmɔho ɔha, na wanya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ nso.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wɔdi ɛkan no mu pii bɛdi akyire, na wɔn a wɔdi akyire no nso mu bi abɛdi ɛkan.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Afuom Adwumayɛfoɔ Ho Abɛbuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>Yesu sane buu wɔn ɛbɛ foforɔ bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie te sɛ okuafoɔ bi a ɔfirii adi anɔpa bi, sɛ ɔrekɔhwehwɛ nnipa abɔ wɔn paa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/><char style="wj">Ne nsa kaa apaafoɔ no, ɔne wɔn hyehyɛɛ sɛ ɔbɛma wɔn ɛda koro adwuma so akatua.</char><verse eid="MAT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ankyɛre ɔfirii adi bio kɔhunuu nnipa bi nso, sɛ wɔgyinagyina hɔ a wɔnyɛ hwee na wɔrehwehwɛ obi ama wabɔ wɔn paa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/><char style="wj">Ɔfaa wɔn nso de wɔn kɔɔ nʼafuo no mu. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn nso sɛ, ɔbɛma wɔn ɛda koro adwuma so akatua.</char><verse eid="MAT 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsane kɔɔ owigyinaeɛ ne nnɔnmiɛnsa ɛberɛ mu kɔbɔɔ nnipa foforɔ paa ne wɔn yɛɛ nhyehyɛeɛ korɔ no ara bi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/><char style="wj">Ɔsane firii adi bɛyɛ nnomum berɛ mu, kɔhunuu sɛ nnipa bi gyinagyina hɔ. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na ɛda mu yi nyinaa mogyinagyina ha a monyɛ hwee?’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔyii ano sɛ, ‘Obi mmɛbɔɔ yɛn paa.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">
    <char style="wj">“Ɛhɔ ara na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Ɛnneɛ monkɔka apaafoɔ a wɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ mʼafuom no ho.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, ɔfrɛɛ deɛ ɔtua nʼapaafoɔ no ka no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Hwɛ na tua wɔn ka, firi wɔn a wɔbaa akyire no so kɔsi wɔn a wɔbaa kane no so.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Apaafoɔ a ɔfaa wɔn akyire no nyinaa, ɔtuaa wɔn ɛda koro apaabɔdeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔfaa wɔn kane no nso baeɛ. Wɔsusuu sɛ wɔbɛnya sika a ɛboro wɔn a ɔfaa wɔn akyire no deɛ no so. Nanso, wɔn nso, ɔtuaa wɔn sɛdeɛ ɔtuaa wɔn a wɔbaa akyire no ara pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/><char style="wj">Wɔn nsa kaa wɔn apaabɔdeɛ no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/><char style="wj">Wɔka kyerɛɛ afuowura no sɛ, ‘Nnipa a wɔbaa akyire no yɛɛ adwuma dɔnhwereɛ baako pɛ, nso yɛn a yɛyɛɛ adwuma firi anɔpa ma owia hyee yɛn no, womaa yɛne wɔn nyinaa akatua pɛ.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔbuaa wɔn mu baako sɛ, ‘Damfo, menyɛɛ wo bɔne biara. Me ne wo anni ano sɛ, mɛma wo ɛda koro adwuma so akatua anaa?</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/><char style="wj">Fa sika a wo nsa aka no na kɔ. Ɛfiri me pɛ mu na meretua wɔn a wɔbaa kane ne wɔn a wɔbaa akyire no nyinaa ka pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/><char style="wj">Mmara bi si me ho ɛkwan sɛ mede me sika yɛ deɛ mepɛ? Anaasɛ mʼayamyɛ enti na wʼani abere yi?’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Asɛm a Yesu ka de wieeɛ ne sɛ, ‘Saa ara na wɔn a wɔdi akyire no bɛdi ɛkan, na wɔn a wɔdi ɛkan no nso bɛdi akyire.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Owuo Ho Nkɔm Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesu siim sɛ ɔrekɔ Yerusalem no, ɔde nʼasuafoɔ no kaa ne ho. <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>Wɔrekɔ no, ɔtwee nʼasuafoɔ no gyinaa nkyɛn baabi ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛrekɔ Yerusalem. Wɔbɛyi me ama asɔfoɔ mpanin ne twerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, na wɔabu me kumfɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/><char style="wj">Wɔde me bɛhyɛ Roma aban nsa, na wɔadi me ho fɛw, abɔ me asɛnnua mu, na ne nnansa so no, mɛsɔre afiri awufoɔ mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maame Bi Abisadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Sebedeo mma Yakobo ne Yohane ne wɔn maame baa Yesu nkyɛn. Ɔbaa yi de adesrɛdeɛ bi bɛtoo Yesu anim.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na wopɛ sɛ menyɛ mma woɔ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Ɔbuaa no sɛ, “Mepɛ sɛ, sɛ wokɔ wʼahennie mu a, me mma baanu yi mu baako tena wo nifa so, na ɔbaako nso tena wo benkum so.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Nanso, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wonnim deɛ worebisa no.”</char> Afei, ɔdanee ne ho bisaa Yakobo ne Yohane sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mobɛtumi anom kuruwa a merebɛnom ano no bi anaa?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Yɛbɛtumi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me kuruwa ano deɛ, mobɛtumi anom, nanso menni tumi sɛ meyi wɔn a wɔbɛtena me nifa anaa me benkum so. Saa afa no wɔ hɔ ma wɔn a mʼagya ayi wɔn no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Asuafoɔ edu a aka no tee deɛ Yakobo ne Yohane akɔbisa no, wɔn bo fuiɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monim sɛ ahene ne atumfoɔ di wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn ase no so. Saa ara nso na wɔn a wɔdi wɔn so no nso di afoforɔ so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/><char style="wj">Nanso, mo deɛ, ɛnte saa wɔ mo mu. Mmom, obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ kɛse wɔ mo mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo ɔsomfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔkannifoɔ wɔ mo mu no, ɔnyɛ mo akoa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no amma sɛ wɔnsom no, na mmom ɔbɛsomoeɛ, na ɔde ne ɔkra too hɔ sɛ agyedeɛ maa nnipa nyinaa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anifirafoɔ Baanu Hunu Adeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ firi Yeriko rekɔ no, nnipadɔm tu dii wɔn akyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Wɔrekɔ no, wɔkɔfaa baabi a anifirafoɔ baanu bi teteɛ. Anifirafoɔ yi tee sɛ Yesu retwam no, wɔteateaam sɛ, “Awurade, Dawid Ba, hunu yɛn mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔdi Yesu akyi no teateaa wɔn sɛ wɔmmua wɔn ano. Nanso, anifirafoɔ no kɔɔ so teateaam sɛ, “Awurade, Dawid Ba, hunu yɛn mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu duruu deɛ wɔteteɛ hɔ no, ɔgyina, bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na mopɛ sɛ meyɛ ma mo?”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Awurade, yɛpɛ sɛ yɛhunu adeɛ!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Anifirafoɔ no yɛɛ Yesu mmɔbɔ. Ɔde ne nsa kekaa wɔn ani, na prɛko pɛ, wɔhunuu adeɛ, na wɔdii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Aka kakra na Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no aduru Yerusalem no, wɔbɛnee kuro bi a wɔfrɛ no Betfage a ɛwɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so hɔ no. Ɛhɔ na Yesu somaa nʼasuafoɔ no mu baanu sɛ, wɔnni ɛkan nkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ moduru hɔ a, mobɛhunu sɛ wɔasa afunumu bi ne ne ba ahoma. Monsane wɔn, na momfa wɔn mmrɛ me.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi bisa mo sɛ ɛdeɛn na moreyɛ a, monka nkyerɛ onipa ko no sɛ, ‘Wɔn ho hia Awurade,’ na ntɛm ara ɔbɛma mo de wɔn aba.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Wɔyɛɛ yei hyɛɛ tete nkɔmhyɛ a ɛka sɛ,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Monka nkyerɛ Ɔbabaa Sion sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">wo ɔhene reba wo nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Ɔdwo, na ɔte afunumu ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">afunumu ba so,” no mu den.<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Asuafoɔ baanu no yɛɛ deɛ Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Wɔde mmoa no brɛɛ no no, wɔde wɔn ntoma sesɛɛ afunumu no so, maa Yesu tenaa ne so. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔwɔ hɔ no bi de wɔn ntoma sesɛɛ ɛkwan a ɔde aboa no nam so no so. Ebinom nso bubuu nnua mman de sesɛɛ ɛkwan no mu saa ara. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Ɛdɔm no tu teneeɛ de osebɔ teateaam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosiana Dawid Ba!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Nhyira ne deɛ ɔnam Awurade din mu reba no.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosiana wɔ ɔsoro nohoa!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔduruu Yerusalem no, kuro no nyinaa bɔɔ twi. Ɛhɔfoɔ no bisaa sɛ, “Na hwan ni?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Nnipadɔm no buaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ Yesu, Odiyifoɔ a ɔfiri Nasaret a ɛwɔ Galileaman mu no.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Asɔrefie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu firii hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ asɔrefie. Ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔpamoo adwadifoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa, kaa sikasesafoɔ apono nyinaa guu fam, bubuu apata a wɔtɔn mmorɔnoma wɔ mu no nyinaa guiɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, ‘Mʼasɔrefie yɛ beaeɛ a wɔbɔ mpaeɛ.’ Nanso, mo deɛ, mode hɔ ayɛ akorɔmfoɔ atenaeɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Afei anifirafoɔ ne mmubuafoɔ baa ne nkyɛn wɔ asɔrefie hɔ ma ɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yadeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin bi hunuu anwanwadeɛ yi na wɔtee nso sɛ mmɔfra nkumaa a wɔwɔ asɔrefie hɔ reteateam sɛ, “Nhyira nka Dawid Ba no” no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Enti, wɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Wote nsɛm a mmɔfra no reka no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aane. Na monkenkanee saa Atwerɛsɛm a ɛka sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mmɔfra ne nkɔkoaa mpo</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="wj">de wɔn ano kamfo wo’ no da anaa?”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Afei, ɔfirii hɔ sane kɔɔ Betania kɔdaa hɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Dome Borɔdɔma Dua Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa a ɔresane akɔ Yerusalem no, ɛkɔm dee no. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Ɔhunuu sɛ borɔdɔma dua bi si ɛkwan ho baabi. Ɔkɔɔ hɔ kɔhwɛɛ sɛ borɔdɔma no bi wɔ so, nanso ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔhunuu sɛ nhahan nko ara na ɛwɔ so. Ɔdomee borɔdɔma dua no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛfiri ɛnnɛ, worenso aba bio!”</char> Ɛhɔ ara borɔdɔma dua no wuiɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Asɛm yi yɛɛ Yesu asuafoɔ no nwanwa ma wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Na ɛyɛɛ ɛdeɛn enti na borɔdɔma dua no so nhahan poroo ntɛm saa?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu nso buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nokorɛm, sɛ mowɔ gyidie a ɛnhinhim a, mobɛtumi ayɛ ade korɔ yi ara bi, anaa deɛ ɛkyɛn saa mpo. Anka mobɛtumi aka akyerɛ Ngo Bepɔ yi sɛ, ‘Tutu kɔgu ɛpo mu’, na ɛbɛtutu akɔgu mu nso.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/><char style="wj">Biribiara a mode gyidie bɛbisa wɔ mpaeɛbɔ mu no, mo nsa bɛka.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tumi Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu sane kɔɔ asɔrefie hɔ a ɔrekyerɛkyerɛ no, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin baa ne kyɛn bɛbisaa no tumi ko a ɔgyina so pamoo adwadifoɔ ne sikasesafoɔ no firii asɔrefie hɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merebɛbisa mo asɛm baako bi, na mommua me ansa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa Yohane Osubɔni anaa ɛnyɛ ɔno?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Wɔdwennwenee ho kaa sɛ, “Sɛ yɛka sɛ ‘Ɛfiri Onyankopɔn’ a, wɔbɛbisa yɛn deɛ enti a yɛannye deɛ Yohane kaeɛ no annie? <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Na sɛ yɛka sɛ, ‘Ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa no’ nso a, ɛdɔm no bɛha yɛn ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn nyinaa nim sɛ Yohane yɛ odiyifoɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Enti, wɔn mmuaeɛ a wɔmaeɛ ara ne sɛ, “Yɛnnim!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu nso kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ monnim deɛ a, me nso meremmua mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmammarima Baanu Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Saa asɛm a merebɛka yi modwene ho sɛn? Ɔbarima bi wɔ mmammarima baanu. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn mu panin no sɛ, ‘Me ba, ɛnnɛ kɔ mʼafuom na kɔyɛ adwuma wɔ hɔ.’</char><verse eid="MAT 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne ba no kaa sɛ, ‘Merenkɔ,’ nanso akyire yi, ɔsesaa nʼadwene na ɔkɔeɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei agya no ka kyerɛɛ akumaa no sɛ, ‘Wo nso kɔ.’ Ɔno nso kaa sɛ, ‘Agya, mate, mɛkɔ.’ Nanso wankɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa mmɔfra baanu yi mu hwan na ɔtie nʼagya asɛm?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Ne ba panin no a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Afei, Yesu kyerɛɛ asɛm no ase sɛ, <char style="wj">“Akyinnyeɛ biara nni ho sɛ abɔnefoɔ ne nnwamanfoɔ bɛkɔ Ɔsoro Ahennie mu ansa na moakɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, Yohane baa mo nkyɛn sɛ ɔrebɛkyerɛ mo tenenee kwan, na moannye no anni. Nanso ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnwamanfoɔ gyee no diiɛ. Na mohunuu yei mpo no, moansakyera mo adwene, na moannye no anni.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaafoɔ Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Yesu buu wɔn bɛ foforɔ bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛda bi, ɔbarima bi a ɔwɔ bobefuo a wagye ban afa ho, na watu amena a wɔkyi nsã wɔ mu, de afuo no gyaa akuafoɔ bi. Yei akyi no, ɔtuu ɛkwan kɔɔ ɔman foforɔ bi so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/><char style="wj">Ɛduruu ɛberɛ a bobe no bereeɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔteɛ no, ɔsomaa ne ho nnipa baa akuafoɔ no hɔ sɛ wɔmmɛgye ne kyɛfa mmrɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔduruu hɔ ara pɛ na akuafoɔ no to hyɛɛ nnipa no so, boroo ɔbaako, kum ɔbaako ɛnna wɔsii ɔbaako nso aboɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/><char style="wj">Afei, ɔsane somaa nnipa a wɔn dodoɔ sene wɔn a ɔsomaa wɔn kane no sɛ wɔnkɔ akuafoɔ no nkyɛn, nanso asɛm korɔ no ara bi na ɛsiiɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/><char style="wj">Yei akyi, ɔsomaa ɔno ankasa ne ba akuafoɔ no nkyɛn susuu sɛ, wɔde anidie bɛma no.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, akuafoɔ no hunuu sɛ ne ba no afiti reba pɛ, wɔfaa ne ho adwene kaa sɛ, ‘Ɔdedifoɔ no na ɔreba no; momma yɛnkum no, na yɛmfa afuo no!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/><char style="wj">Ɛhɔ ara, wɔtwee no firii afuo no mu, kɔkumm no too baabi.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ afuowura no sane ba a, mogye di sɛ ɛdeɛn na ɔbɛyɛ saa akuafoɔ no?”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin no buaa sɛ, “Ɔno nso bɛkum saa atirimuɔdenfoɔ no na ɔde afuo no ama akuafoɔ foforɔ a wɔde ne kyɛfa bɛma no ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkanee Twerɛsɛm no mu da sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɛboɔ a adansifoɔ apo no</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">ɛno ara na abɛyɛ ɛdan no ntweaso tiboɔ.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">Awurade na wayɛ yei,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">na ɛyɛ nwanwa wɔ yɛn ani so?’</char><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Deɛ mereka ara ne sɛ, wɔbɛgye Onyankopɔn Ahennie no afiri mo nsam de akɔma ɔman foforɔ a wɔbɛbu nʼafudeɛ no ho nkonta pa akyerɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔbɛhwe saa botan yi so no mu bɛbubu, na deɛ nokorɛ no bɛhwe ne so no nso bɛpɛkyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Ɛberɛ a asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin no tee aseɛ sɛ Yesu asɛm a ɔreka no fa wɔn ho no, <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔyɛ no bɔne, nanso na wɔsuro ɛdɔm no ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔagye Yesu atom sɛ ɔyɛ Odiyifoɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayeforɔhyia Apontoɔ Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu de mmɛbuo ahodoɔ kyerɛɛ sɛdeɛ Ɔsoro Ahennie no teɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>Ɔse, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie no te sɛ ɔhene bi a ne babarima hyiaa ayeforɔ na ɔtoo pon maa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/><char style="wj">Ɔtoo nsa frɛɛ nnipa pii. Ɛberɛ no duruiɛ no, ɔsomaa nʼasomfoɔ sɛ wɔnkɔfrɛfrɛ nnipa no na wɔmmra. Nanso, nnipa no amma.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsane somaa nʼasomfoɔ foforɔ sɛ, ‘Monkɔka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔawie biribiara. Wɔakum mʼanantwie ne me nyɛmmoa de anoa aduane awie. Mommra ayeforɔ no ase mmɛdidi!’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, ne ho yɛɛ wɔn a ɔtoo nsa frɛɛ wɔn no sere. Obiara kɔdii ne dwuma. Obi kɔɔ nʼafuom. Ɔfoforɔ nso kɔdii ne dwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/><char style="wj">Afoforɔ nso kyeree nʼasomfoɔ no hwee wɔn, pirapiraa wɔn, kunkumm ebinom nso.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/><char style="wj">Ɔhene no tee deɛ nnipa no ayɛ nʼasomfoɔ no, ne bo fuiɛ. Ɔsomaa nʼasraafoɔ ma wɔkɔkunkum awudifoɔ no, hyee wɔn kuro no pasaa.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsane frɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Wɔawie ayeforɔ aduane no. Nanso, wɔn a mefrɛɛ wɔn no mfata sɛ wɔba apontoɔ no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/><char style="wj">Enti, monkɔ mmɔntene so na obiara a mobɛhunu no no, momfrɛ no mmra apontoɔ no ase.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/><char style="wj">Asomfoɔ no firii adi kɔɔ mmɔntene so kɔfrɛɛ nnipa dodoɔ a wɔhunuu wɔn no nyinaa. Wɔfrɛɛ nnipa pa ne nnipa bɔne, maa ɛdan a wɔtoo ɛpono wɔ mu no yɛɛ ma.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔhene no baa hɔ sɛ ɔrebɛhwɛ nnipa a wɔaba no, ɔhunuu obi a ɔnhyɛ ayeforɔhyia atadeɛ wɔ hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/><char style="wj">Ɔbisaa no sɛ, ‘Damfo, ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wonhyɛ ayeforɔhyia atadeɛ, na wotumi baa ha?’ Nanso, damfo no antumi ammua.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ no sɛ, ‘Monkyekyere ne nan ne ne nsa na monkɔto no ntwene akyirikyiri esum mu, deɛ esu ne agyaadwoɔ wɔ no.’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔafrɛ bebree, nanso kakra bi na wɔayi wɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtoɔ Yie Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Farisifoɔ no tuu Yesu ho agyina, pɛɛ ɛkwan bi a wɔnam nʼanom asɛm so bɛnya no akyere no. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Wɔsii no gyinaeɛ sɛ, wɔbɛsoma wɔn nnipa bi ne Herodefoɔ aba Yesu nkyɛn abɛbisa no sɛ, “Owura, yɛnim sɛ woyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ, na wonam nokorɛ kwan so kyerɛ nnipa ɛkwan a ɛkɔ Onyankopɔn nkyɛn a wonsuro akyire asɛm, ɛfiri sɛ, wonhwɛ nnipa anim. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Ka ma yɛntie. Ɛyɛ sɛ wɔyi toɔ ma Roma Hempɔn Kaesare anaa ɛnyɛ?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwemmɔne no ma ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nyaatwomfoɔ! Adɛn enti na mopɛ sɛ mode nnaadaa sɔ me hwɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/><char style="wj">Momfa sika a wɔde yi toɔ no bi nkyerɛ me.”</char> Wɔde bi kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwan mfoni na ɛda so, na hwan din nso na ɛwɔ so?”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Kaesare.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ, momfa Kaesare deɛ mma Kaesare, na momfa Onyankopɔn deɛ mma Onyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Ne mmuaeɛ a ɔmaa wɔn no maa wɔn ho dwirii wɔn ma wɔgyaa no hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔreɛ Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Ɛda no ara, Sadukifoɔ a wɔnnye owusɔreɛ nni no baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>“Owura, Mose kaa sɛ, ‘Sɛ ɔbarima bi anwo na ɔwu a, ne nuabarima mfa ne yere no kunabaa na ɔne no nwo mma owufoɔ no. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Anuanom baason bi ne yɛn tenaa ha. Ɔpanin no wareeɛ a wanwo ba na ɔwuiɛ. Enti, ne nua a ɔtɔ so mmienu no faa ne yere no kunabaa. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Deɛ ɔtɔ so mmienu no nso wuiɛ, maa deɛ ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no faa ɔbaa no kunabaa. Ɔno nso wuiɛ a wanwo ba, maa ɔfoforɔ nso faa ɔbaa no kunabaa. Yei toaa so ara kɔsii sɛ anuanom baason no nyinaa waree ɔbaa no. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Deɛ ɛdi akyire ne sɛ, ɔbaa no nso wuiɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Ɛno enti, owusɔreberɛ no, nnipa baason yi mu hwan na ɔbaa no bɛyɛ ne yere? Ɛfiri sɛ wɔn nyinaa waree no!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mfomsoɔ a moayɛ no firi nim a monnim Atwerɛsɛm no ne Onyankopɔn tumi a ɔwɔ no!</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/><char style="wj">Na owusɔreberɛ no, awadeɛ nni hɔ; obiara bɛyɛ sɛ abɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ ɔsoro no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/><char style="wj">Afei, ɛfa owusɔreɛ no ho no nso, monnkanee deɛ Onyankopɔn aka afa ho no pɛn? Monhunu sɛ Onyankopɔn kasa kyerɛɛ mo ɛberɛ a ɔkaa sɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/><char style="wj">‘Mene Abraham Onyankopɔn, Isak Onyankopɔn ne Yakob Onyankopɔn no?’ Yei kyerɛ sɛ. Onyankopɔn nyɛ awufoɔ Onyankopɔn na mmom, ateasefoɔ Onyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Nnipadɔm no tee ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no, ɛyɛɛ wɔn nwanwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmaransɛm No Mu Kɛseɛ Pa Ara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Farisifoɔ no tee sɛ Yesu abu afa Sadukifoɔ no so no, wɔkɔhyiaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Wɔn mu baako a ɔyɛ mmaranimfoɔ bisaa Yesu sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Owura, Mose mmaransɛm no mu deɛ ɛwɔ he koraa na ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“ ‘Dɔ Awurade, wo Onyankopɔn, wʼakoma nyinaa mu ne wo ɔkra nyinaa mu ne wʼadwene nyinaa mu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/><char style="wj">Yei ne mmaransɛm no mu deɛ ɛdi ɛkan na ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɛtɔ so mmienu no te sɛ ɛno ara: ‘Dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/><char style="wj">Mose mmaransɛm ne adiyifoɔ no nkyerɛkyerɛ no nyinaa gyina saa mmaransɛm mmienu yi so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hwan Ba Ne Agyenkwa No?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Farisifoɔ no twaa Yesu ho hyiaeɛ no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na mowɔ ka wɔ Agyenkwa no ho? Hwan ba ne no?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Dawid Ba.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ, adɛn na Dawid nam Honhom Kronkron so frɛ no ‘Awurade’? Ɛfiri sɛ, Dawid kaa sɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me wura sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">“Tena me nifa</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">kɔsi sɛ mɛma woadi</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">wʼatamfoɔ nyinaa so.” ’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>
    <char style="wj">Sɛ Dawid frɛ no ‘Awurade’ a, ɛnneɛ ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na watumi ayɛ ne ba?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Obiara antumi ammua. Yei akyi nso, obiara antumi ammisa no nsɛm bio.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ka Atwerɛsɛm No Akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ Ne Farisifoɔ Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no ne nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/><char style="wj">“Atwerɛsɛm no Akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ne Farisifoɔ no na wɔkyerɛ Mose mmara no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/><char style="wj">Yei enti, ɛsɛ sɛ motie wɔn, na moyɛ biribiara a wɔkyerɛ mo. Nanso, monnyɛ deɛ wɔyɛ no bi ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ wɔka no, ɛnyɛ ɛno na wɔyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/><char style="wj">Wɔhyɛ mo, ma modi mmara a ɛyɛ den so a wɔn ankasa mpɛ sɛ wɔdi so.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Biribiara a wɔyɛ no yɛ ɔyɛkyerɛ. Wɔatwerɛ Onyame Asɛm abɔ wɔn moma ne wɔn nsa so, na wɔhyɛ wɔn ntadeɛ de kyerɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ateneneefoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wɔkɔ apontoɔ ase nso a, wɔpɛ sɛ daa wɔtena mpanin tenabea. Afei, wɔkɔ asɔre nso a, wɔpɛ sɛ wɔtena mpanin tenabea pa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wode obuo kyea wɔn abɔntene so na wofrɛ wɔn ‘Rabi’ anaa ‘Owura’ a, ɛyɛ wɔn dɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommma obiara mfrɛ mo saa. Ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn nko ara na ɔyɛ Owura. Mo nyinaa moyɛ pɛ sɛ anuanom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/><char style="wj">Mommfrɛ obiara wɔ asase so ha sɛ ‘Agya,’ ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔfrɛ no saa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/><char style="wj">Na mommma wɔmmfrɛ mo ‘Owura,’ ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbaako pɛ na ɔyɛ mo wura a ɔne Agyenkwa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/><char style="wj">Wobrɛ wo ho ase som afoforɔ a, wobɛyɛ ɔkɛseɛ. Wopɛ sɛ woyɛ kɛse a, yɛ ɔsomfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbɛma ne ho so no, wɔbɛbrɛ no ase; saa ara nso na obiara a ɔbɛbrɛ ne ho ase no, wɔbɛma no so.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kasa Tia Nyaatwomyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Mo Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ nyaatwomfoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, mosi afoforɔ Ɔsoro Ahennie ho ɛkwan. Mo a, monkɔ mu. Mo nso a, momma afoforɔ a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkɔ mu no ɛkwan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/><char style="wj">Nyaatwomfoɔ! Mobɔ mpaeɛ atentene wɔ mmɔntene so de kyerɛ sɛ moyɛ ateneneefoɔ wɔ ɛberɛ a motu akunafoɔ firi wɔn afie mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Mo Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ nyaatwomfoɔ! Mokɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa sɛ mobɛnya onipa fua abɛfra mo mu. Na sɛ monya obi saa a, mosɛe no ma ɔyɛ ɔbonsam ba sene sɛdeɛ moteɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Akwankyerɛfoɔ anifirafoɔ a moka sɛ, sɛ obi de asɔredan ka ntam a, ɛno deɛ, ɛnyɛ hwee. Na sɛ ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ a ɛwɔ asɔredan no mu ka ntam deɛ a, ɛnneɛ, ntam no kyekyere onii no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/><char style="wj">Anifirafoɔ nkwaseafoɔ! Asɔredan no ne emu sikakɔkɔɔ no mu deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛsom bo; sikakɔkɔɔ no anaa asɔredan no a ɛte sikakɔkɔɔ no ho no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/><char style="wj">Na moka sɛ, ‘Sɛ obi ka afɔrebukyia no ntam a, ɛnyɛ hwee. Na mmom, sɛ ɔka ayɛyɛdeɛ a ɛgu afɔrebukyia no so ntam deɛ a, ɛkyekyere onii no’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/><char style="wj">Anifirafoɔ! Afɔrebukyia a ɛte ayɛyɛdeɛ a ɛgu so no ho no ne ayɛyɛdeɛ a ɛgu so no mu deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛsom bo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woka afɔrebukyia no ntam a, woka afɔrebukyia no ne ɛso ayɛyɛdeɛ no nyinaa ntam,</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/><char style="wj">na sɛ woka asɔredan no ntam a, woka asɔredan no ne Onyankopɔn a ɔte mu no nyinaa ntam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ woka ɔsoro ntam a, na woreka Onyankopɔn ahennwa ne Onyankopɔn no ankasa ntam.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Mo Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ nyaatwomfoɔ! Moyi ntotosoɔ dudu wɔ afifideɛ a ɛwɔ mo mfikyifuo mu no ho, nanso mogya nneɛma a ɛsom bo te sɛ atɛntenenee, ahummɔborɔ ne nokorɛdie. Ɛwom sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moyiyi ntotosoɔ dudu no deɛ, nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mogya nneɛma a ɛsom bo no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/><char style="wj">Anifirafoɔ akwankyerɛfoɔ! Mosɔne deɛ morenom so, yi mu nwansena nanso momene yoma!</char><verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Mo Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ nyaatwomfoɔ! Motwi mo kuruwa ne mo ayowaa ho fɛfɛɛfɛ nanso emu no deɛ, asisie ne pɛsɛmenkomenya ahyɛ no ma tɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/><char style="wj">Farisifoɔ anifirafoɔ! Montwi kuruwa no mu kane, na kuruwa no ho nyinaa bɛte!</char><verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Mo Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ! Mote sɛ ɛda a wɔasra ho fɛfɛɛfɛ nanso awufoɔ nnompe ne nneɛma funu ahyɛ mu ma tɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/><char style="wj">Moyɛ mo anim sɛ ateneneefoɔ, nanso bɔne ahodoɔ ahyɛ mo mu ma tɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Mo Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ nyaatwomfoɔ! Mosisi nna akɛseɛ ma adiyifoɔ a mo ara mo agyanom kunkumm wɔn, na mode nhwiren gugu ateneneefoɔ a wɔkunkum wɔn no da so,</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/><char style="wj">na motwa mo ho ka sɛ, ‘Sɛ na yɛte ase saa ɛberɛ no a, anka yɛrenyɛ bɔne a yɛn agyanom yɛeɛ no.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moka saa a, mobu mo ho fɔ sɛ moyɛ atirimuɔdenfoɔ mma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/><char style="wj">Na modi wɔn anammɔn akyi yɛ saa bɔne korɔ no ara bi pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Awɔ! Nhurutoa mma! Mobɛyɛ dɛn adwane amanehunu ogya mu atemmuo no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/><char style="wj">Mɛsoma adiyifoɔ ne anyansafoɔ ne akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ aba mo nkyɛn. Mobɛbɔ wɔn mu bi asɛnnua mu akum wɔn. Mobɛbɔ ebinom akyi mmaa wɔ mo asɔredan mu, na moataa ebi firi nkuro so akɔ nkuro so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/><char style="wj">Na ateneneefoɔ mogya a moahwie agu asase so nyinaa, ɛfiri Habel so de kɔsi Barakia ba Sakaria a mokumm no wɔ asɔredan ne afɔrebukyia ntam no, bɛba mo so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/><char style="wj">Mereka makyerɛ mo sɛ, atemmuo a wɔaboaboa ano no nyinaa bɛba nnɛmma yi so.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ao Yerusalem, Yerusalem, wo a wokum adiyifoɔ, na wosi wɔn a wɔasoma wɔn wo nkyɛn aboɔ, mpɛn ahe na anka mepɛɛ sɛ meboaboa wo mma ano, sɛdeɛ akokɔbaatan boaboa ne mma ano ne ntaban ase, nanso moampɛ!</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɛgya mo efie fituo ama mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/><char style="wj">Na mese mo sɛ, ɛfiri sɛsɛɛ morenhunu me bio kɔsi sɛ, mobɛka sɛ, ‘Nhyira ne deɛ ɔnam Awurade din mu reba no.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔredansɛeɛ Ho Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu refiri baabi a asɔredan no si hɔ no, nʼasuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyerɛkyerɛ no adan ahodoɔ a ɛwɔ asɔredan no mu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Nanso, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔbɛdwiri saa dan yi agu pasaa!”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhaw Ne Ɔtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesu kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so. Ɔte hɔ no, nʼasuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛberɛ bɛn na deɛ woreka yi bɛba? Na nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bɛn na ɛbɛma yɛahunu wo ba a wobɛsane aba bio no ne ewiase awieeɛ a ɛbɛba no?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ na obi annaadaa mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/><char style="wj">Nnipa bebree de me din bɛba abɛka sɛ, wɔne Agyenkwa no, na wɔadaadaa mo mu pii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mote sɛ akokoakoko resi afanan nyinaa a, ɛnkyerɛ me ba a mɛsane aba no ho nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ. Ɛsɛ sɛ yeinom ba, nanso awieeɛ no deɛ, ɛnnya mmaeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/><char style="wj">Aman bɛsɔre aman so, na ahennie asɔre ahennie so, na ɛkɔm ne asasewosoɔ bɛba mmeammea.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/><char style="wj">Yeinom nyinaa bɛyɛ nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu a ɛbɛba no mfitiaseɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ moyɛ me deɛ enti, wɔbɛyɛ mo ayayadeɛ, na wɔakum mo wɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/><char style="wj">na mo mu pii bɛsane akɔ bɔne mu, na moayiyi mo ho mo ho ama, na moatan mo ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/><char style="wj">Atorɔ adiyifoɔ bebree bɛsɔre, na wɔadaadaa mo mu pii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/><char style="wj">Bɔne bɛdɔɔso wɔ ewiase, na abrɛ nnipa dɔ a wɔwɔ no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wɔn a wɔbɛgyina pintinn akɔduru awieeɛ no, wɔbɛgye wɔn nkwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/><char style="wj">Na wɔbɛka asɛmpa a ɛfa Ahennie no ho no wɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa, na wɔate. Ɛno akyi ansa na awieeɛ no bɛba.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahohia A Ɛyɛ Hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, sɛ mohunu ‘Adeɛ a Ɛyɛ Hu’ a, Odiyifoɔ Daniel kaa ho asɛm sɛ ɛgyina kronkronbea hɔ no a, ma deɛ ɔkenkan no nte aseɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/><char style="wj">wɔn a wɔte Yudea no nnwane nkɔ Yuda mmepɔ so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/><char style="wj">Mma obiara a ɔwɔ ne efie ɛdan atifi no nsiane nkɔfa biribiara mfiri ne efie hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔwɔ mfuom no nso nnsane wɔn akyi mmɛfa wɔn ntoma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wɔafa afuro ne wɔn a wɔturu mma saa ɛberɛ no mu no nnue!</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/><char style="wj">Na mommɔ mpaeɛ na ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ modwane no anyɛ awɔberɛ anaa Homeda.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔtaa a ɛbɛba no, ebi nsii wɔ ewiase abakɔsɛm mu da, na ebi nso rensi da.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nokorɛm, sɛ wɔantwa saa nna no so a, nnipa nyinaa ase bɛtɔre.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo sɛ, ‘Agyenkwa no wɔ ha anaasɛ ɔwɔ nohoa anaa wayi ne ho adi wɔ ha anaa ɛhɔ’ a, monnye nni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/><char style="wj">Atorɔ Akristofoɔ ne atorɔ adiyifoɔ bɛsɔre, na wɔayɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ na sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, wɔadaadaa wɔn mpo a Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/><char style="wj">Mabɔ mo kɔkɔ dada.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo sɛ, ‘Agyenkwa no asane aba na ɔwɔ ɛserɛ so a,’ monnha mo ho sɛ mobɛkɔ hɔ akɔhwehwɛ no; ‘anaasɛ nso ɔde ne ho asie baabi a,’ monnye nni!</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/><char style="wj">Na sɛdeɛ anyinam pa firi apueeɛ kɔ atɔeɛ no, saa ara na sɛ Onipa Ba no reba a, ɛbɛyɛ ara ne no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ efunu wɔ no, ɛhɔ na apete mpa.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔtaa no akyiri pɛ</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘awia bɛduru sum,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">na ɔsrane renhyerɛn;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">na nsoromma bɛtete ahwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">na wɔbɛwoso tumi a ɛwɔ ɔsoro no.’</char><verse eid="MAT 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, Onipa Ba no ho nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bɛda adi, na ɛsoro ne asase sofoɔ nyinaa bɛtwa agyaadwoɔ. Na ewiase amanaman bɛhunu me, sɛ mede tumi ne animuonyam nam ɛsoro omununkum mu reba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/><char style="wj">Na mɛsoma mʼabɔfoɔ a wɔrebɔ totorobɛnto aba, na wɔbɛboaboa wɔn a mayi wɔn no ano firi ɛsoro ano kɔka asase ano.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, monsua biribi mfiri borɔdɔma dua no ho asɛm no mu. Sɛ ɛyi mman foforɔ, sane yi ahahan foforɔ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ asusɔ abɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ mohunu sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa afiti aseɛ resisi a, mobɛhunu sɛ meba a mɛsane aba no abɛn, aduru apono ano.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/><char style="wj">Nokorɛ mese mo sɛ, awontoatoasoɔ yi rentwam, gye sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa aba mu ansa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/><char style="wj">Ɛsoro ne asase bɛtwam akɔ, na me nsɛm deɛ, ɛbɛtena hɔ daa.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, ɛda anaa dɔn ko a awieeɛ no bɛba deɛ, obiara nnim. Ɔsoro abɔfoɔ ne Onyankopɔn Ba no mpo nnim. Agya no nko na ɔnim.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no ba a ɔbɛba no bɛyɛ sɛdeɛ Noa berɛ so ɛyɛeɛ no ara pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/><char style="wj">Na sɛdeɛ nna a ɛdi nsuyire no anim no, nnipa didiiɛ, na wɔnomeeɛ, warewareeɛ, de kɔsii ɛda a Noa kɔɔ ɛhyɛn no mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/><char style="wj">na nnipa annye deɛ ɛbɛba anni, kɔsii sɛ nsuyire bɛfaa wɔn nyinaa kɔeɛ no, saa ara na Onipa Ba no ba a ɔbɛsane aba no bɛyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛberɛ no, wɔbɛfa mmarima baanu a wɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ afuom no mu baako akɔ, na wɔagya ɔbaako.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na mmaa baanu a wɔwɔ efie renoa aduane no nso, wɔbɛfa ɔbaako agya ɔbaako no no.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, monwɛn ɛfiri sɛ, monnim da ko a Awurade bɛba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ onipa tumi wɛn de bɔ ne ho ban firi akorɔmfoɔ ho no,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/><char style="wj">saa ara na ɛwɔ sɛ mosiesie mo ho, ɛfiri sɛ Onipa Ba no bɛba ɛberɛ a mo ani nna so sɛ ɔbɛba.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akoa Pa Anaa Akoa Bɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hwan ne ɔsomfoɔ nokwafoɔ nyansafoɔ no, deɛ ne wura de ne fidua mu asomfoɔ ahyɛ ne nsa sɛ ɔmma wɔn adwuma wɔ ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/><char style="wj">Nhyira ne ɔsomfoɔ a ne wura no bɛba abɛto no sɛ wayɛ nʼadwuma pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/><char style="wj">Nokorɛm, ɔde nʼagyapadeɛ nyinaa bɛhyɛ ne nsa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔyɛ akoa bɔne, na ɔka kyerɛ ne ho sɛ, ‘Me Wura nnya mmaeɛ,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/><char style="wj">na ɔhyɛ aseɛ ha ne mfɛfoɔ nkoa, na ɔdidi, boro nsã a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/><char style="wj">ne Wura no bɛba ɛda a nʼani nna so sɛ ɔbɛba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/><char style="wj">Ɔbɛtwe nʼaso denden, na ɔde no akɔ baabi a wɔbu nyaatwomfoɔ atɛn; ɛhɔ na wɔtwa agyaadwoɔ na wɔtwɛre wɔn se.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmabaawa Edu No Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahennie te sɛ mmabaawa edu bi a wɔfaa wɔn nkanea sɛ wɔrekɔhyia ayeforɔkunu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/><char style="wj">Na mmabaawa no mu baanum yɛ anyansafoɔ ɛnna baanum nso yɛ nkwaseafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/><char style="wj">Wɔn mu nkwaseafoɔ no rekɔ no, wɔfaa wɔn nkanea nanso wɔamfa ngo anka ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wɔn mu anyansafoɔ no deɛ, wɔrekorɔ no, wɔfaa ngo kaa wɔn nkanea ho de kɔeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/><char style="wj">Ayeforɔkunu no amma ntɛm, enti wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ totɔɔ nko dedaeɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔdasuom na wɔtee nteateamu sɛ, ‘Ayeforɔkunu no reba! Momfiri adi nkɔhyia no!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mmabaawa yi nyinaa sɔre buebuee wɔn nkanea no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/><char style="wj">Nkwaseafoɔ no srɛɛ anyansafoɔ no sɛ, ‘Momma yɛn mo ngo no bi ngu yɛn nkanea no mu na ɛredum.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anyansafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Krasin a yɛwɔ no sua. Monkɔ kurom nkɔtɔ bi.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔrekɔtɔ ngo no pɛ, na ayeforɔkunu no baeɛ. Enti, wɔn a wɔasiesie wɔn ho no ne ayeforɔkunu no kɔɔ nʼapontoɔ no ase, na wɔtoo ɛpono no mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akyire yi a baanum no sane baeɛ no, wɔgyinaa ɛpono no akyi frɛɛ sɛ, ‘Owura, hini yɛn!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Momfiri hɔ nkɔ. Mennim mo!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, monwɛn na monnim da anaa dɔn ko a mɛsane aba.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaafoɔ Baasa Bi Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bio, Ɔsoro Ahennie te sɛ ɔbarima bi a ɔretu ɛkwan akɔ ɔman foforɔ bi so. Ɔrekɔ no, ɔfrɛɛ nʼapaafoɔ baasa, maa wɔn mu biara sika a ɛfata sɛ wɔmfa nyɛ adwuma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/><char style="wj">Ɔmaa ɔbaako dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson. Ɔmaa deɛ ɔdi hɔ no dwetɛ kilogram aduosia nnwɔtwe ɛnna ɔmaa deɛ ɔtwa toɔ no dwetɛ kilogram aduasa ɛnan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/><char style="wj">Ɔpaani a ɔmaa no dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson no de sika no kɔdii dwa, nyaa mfasoɔ dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson kaa ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔnyaa dwetɛ kilogram aduosia nnwɔtwe no nso de sika no kɔyɛɛ adwuma nyaa mfasoɔ dwetɛ kilogram aduosia nnwɔtwe kaa ne sika no ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/><char style="wj">Nanso, ɔpaani a ne wura maa no dwetɛ kilogram aduasa ɛnan no deɛ, ɔkɔtuu fam de sika no siee hɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mmerɛ bi akyi, wɔn wura no firi akwantuo mu baeɛ. Ɔfrɛɛ apaafoɔ baasa yi sɛ wɔmmɛbu nkonta nkyerɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔnyaa dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson no de dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson kaa ho baeɛ. Ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Me wura, womaa me dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson. Hwɛ, manya dwetɛ kilogram ɔha aduɔson aka ho.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Mo, akoa pa ne nokwafoɔ, woadi kakra yi ho nokorɛ, mede wo bɛsi nneɛma pii so panin. Bra, na me ne wo nni dɛ!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔpaani a ɔmaa no dwetɛ kilogram aduosia nnwɔtwe no nso baeɛ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ ne wura no sɛ, ‘Worekɔ no, womaa me dwetɛ kilogram aduosia nnwɔtwe. Mede yɛɛ adwuma, na manya dwetɛ kilogram aduosia nnwɔtwe aka ho.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Mo, akoa pa ne nokwafoɔ, woadi kakra yi ho nokorɛ, mede wo bɛsi nneɛma pii so panin. Bra wo wura anigyeɛ mu!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔpaani a ɔnyaa dwetɛ kilogram aduasa ɛnan no nso baeɛ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ ne wura no sɛ, ‘Owura, menim sɛ woyɛ onipa a wʼasɛm yɛ den. Wotumi twa wɔ deɛ wonnuaeɛ, ɛnna wotumi boaboa ano wɔ deɛ wompeteeɛ;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/><char style="wj">enti mesuroeɛ, na mede wo sika no kɔhyɛɛ fam, enti wʼadeɛ nie!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Akoa bɔne ne onihafoɔ! Wonim sɛ metumi twa wɔ deɛ mennuaeɛ, na metumi boaboa ano wɔ deɛ mempeteeɛ a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/><char style="wj">anka ɛsɛ sɛ wode sika no kɔto sikakorabea nya nsiho to hɔ ma me.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Monnye ne nsam sika no, na momfa nkɔma deɛ ɔnyaa dwetɛ kilogram ahasa aduanan no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔde deɛ wɔde ama no no bɛyɛ ade pa no, wɔde bi bɛka no ho. Na obiara a wamfa deɛ wɔde ama no no anyɛ ade pa no, deɛ ɔwɔ no mpo, wɔbɛgye afiri ne nsam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/><char style="wj">Monto akoa a ne ho nni mfasoɔ yi ntwene esum kabii mu: ɛhɔ na esu ne agyaadwoɔ wɔ.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atemmuo Da No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ Onipa Ba no ba nʼanimuonyam mu a abɔfoɔ nyinaa ka ne ho a, saa ɛberɛ no na ɔbɛtena nʼanimuonyam ahennwa no so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/><char style="wj">Na wɔbɛboaboa aman nyinaa ano nʼanim. Na ɔbɛpa nnipa no mu sɛdeɛ odwanhwɛfoɔ pa nnwan firi mpɔnkye mu;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/><char style="wj">na ɔde nnwan no bɛgyina ne nifa so, na ɔde mpɔnkye no agyina ne benkum so</char>.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛno na Ɔhene no bɛka akyerɛ wɔn a wɔgyina ne nifa so no sɛ, ‘Mo a mʼagya ahyira mo, mommra mmɛfa ahennie a wɔasiesie ama mo firi ewiase ahyɛaseɛ no nni!</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/><char style="wj">Ɛkɔm dee me, na momaa me aduane diiɛ. Sukɔm dee me, na momaa me nsuo nomeeɛ. Meyɛɛ ɔhɔhoɔ, na mode me kɔɔ mo fie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/><char style="wj">Medaa adagya na mofiraa me ntoma. Meyareeɛ, na mobɛsraa me. Medaa afiase, na mobɛhwɛɛ me.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ɛberɛ no mu na ateneneefoɔ bɛbisa sɛ, ‘Owura, da bɛn na yɛhunuu wo sɛ ɛkɔm de wo a, yɛmaa wo aduane, na sukɔm de wo a yɛmaa wo nsuo nomeeɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/><char style="wj">Afei, da bɛn na yɛhunuu sɛ woyɛɛ ɔhɔhoɔ a, yɛde wo kɔɔ yɛn fie, anaasɛ wodaa adagya a, yɛfiraa wo ntoma?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/><char style="wj">Afei, da bɛn na yɛhunuu sɛ woyare a, yɛbɛsraa wo, anaasɛ wodaa afiase a, yɛbɛhwɛɛ wo?’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na Ɔhene no, bɛbua wɔn sɛ, ‘Sɛ moayɛ ama me nuanom nkumaa yi mu baako yi, moayɛ ama me!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, mɛdane mʼani akyerɛ wɔn a wɔgyina me benkum so no aka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Mo a wɔadome mo, wɔmfa mo nkɔgu ogyatannaa a ɛnnum da a wɔasɔ ama ɔbonsam ne nʼahokafoɔ no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/><char style="wj">Na ɛkɔm dee me, moamma me aduane anni, sukɔm dee me, moamma me nsuo annom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/><char style="wj">Meyɛɛ ɔhɔhoɔ, moamfa me ankɔ mo fie. Medaa adagya, moamfira me ntoma. Meyareeɛ, moammɛsra me. Medaa afiase, moammɛhwɛ me.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔn nso bɛbua no sɛ, ‘Awurade, da bɛn na yɛhunuu wo sɛ ɛkɔm dee wo, anaasɛ sukɔm dee wo, anaasɛ woyɛɛ ɔhɔhoɔ, anaasɛ wodaa adagya, anaasɛ woyareeɛ, anaasɛ wodaa afiase, na yɛanyɛ deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ amma wo?’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mɛbua wɔn sɛ, ‘Sɛ moanyɛ amma nkumaa yi mu baako enti, moanyɛ amma me.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na wɔbɛkɔ ahoyera a ɛtoɔ ntwa da mu, na ateneneefoɔ akɔ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Ho Pɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu wiee nsɛm yi nyinaa ka no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/><char style="wj">“Monim sɛ aka nnanu na Twam Afahyɛ no aduru, na wɔbɛyi Onipa Ba no ama, na wɔabɔ no asɛnnua mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara na asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin bi ahyia mu wɔ Ɔsɔfopanin Kaiafa efie, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>retu agyina ahwehwɛ ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so akyere Yesu, akum no a obiara renhunu akyire. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Nanso, wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔkyere no Twam Afahyɛ no mu, anyɛ saa a, ɛde basabasayɛ bɛba ɔman no mu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsra Yesu Ngo Wɔ Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Afei, Yesu kɔɔ Betania na ɔkɔɔ Simon ɔkwatani efie. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Ɔwɔ hɔ redidi no, ɔbaa bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maria a ɔyɛ Marta ne Lasaro nuabaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh 12.3</ref></char>)</char></note> a ɔkura ngo hwamhwam bi a ne boɔ yɛ den yie toa ma baa hɔ, bɛhwie guu Yesu tirim.<verse eid="MAT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Asuafoɔ no hunuiɛ no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ. Wɔkaa sɛ, “Adesɛeɛ yi ase ne sɛn? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Anka wɔbɛtumi atɔn sradeɛ hwamhwam yi anya sika bebree de ama ahiafoɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwene, na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na moka deɛ ɔbaa yi yɛeɛ yi ho asɛm saa? Wayɛ ade pa ama me.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/><char style="wj">Mo ne ahiafoɔ wɔ ha daa, na me deɛ, me ne mo nni hɔ daa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/><char style="wj">Wahwie ngo hwamhwam yi agu me so, de asiesie me onipadua ama me sie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/><char style="wj">Wɔde deɛ ɔyɛeɛ yi bɛkae no daa. Wɔbɛka deɛ ɔyɛeɛ yi wɔ ewiase baabiara a wɔka asɛmpa no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Pene So Sɛ Ɔbɛyi Yesu Ama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Afei, Yuda Iskariot a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako kɔɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin no nkyɛn, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>kɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ meyi Yesu ma mo a, ahe na mode bɛma me?” Wɔmaa no dwetɛ mpɔ aduasa <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, Yuda hwehwɛɛ kwan a ɔbɛfa so ayi no ama wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Nʼasuafoɔ Adidie A Ɛdi Akyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Apiti Afahyɛ da a ɛdi ɛkan no, asuafoɔ no baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛhe na wopɛ sɛ yɛkɔdi Twam Afahyɛ no?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkɔ kuro no mu nkɔhunu ɔpanin asomasi nka nkyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Yɛn Wura se, ne berɛ abɛn, na wo fie na ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no bɛdi Twam Afahyɛ no.’ ”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Asuafoɔ no dii deɛ ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn no so, yɛɛ Twam Afahyɛ aduane a wɔbɛdi wɔ efie a wɔnyaeɛ no mu.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Ɛduruu anwummerɛ a ɔne Dumienu no te adidiiɛ no, <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mu baako bɛyi me ama.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Asɛm yi maa wɔn werɛ hoo yie, na wɔfirii aseɛ bisabisaa mmaako mmaako sɛ, “Awurade, ɛyɛ me anaa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɔne me didi ayowaa baako mu no, ɔno na ɔbɛyi me ama.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/><char style="wj">Ɛsɛ sɛ Onipa Ba no wu sɛdeɛ odiyifoɔ no hyɛɛ ne ho nkɔm no; nanso onipa a ɔbɛyi Onipa Ba no ama no, nnue! Sɛ wanwo saa onipa no a, anka ɛyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yuda nso bisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ɛyɛ me anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aane.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidi Kronkron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔredidi no. Yesu faa burodo, na ɔhyiraa so bubuu mu, de maa nʼasuafoɔ no kaa sɛ: <char style="wj">“Monnye nni, yei ne me onipadua.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Na ɔfaa kuruwa no, na ɔdaa ase no, ɔde maa wɔn kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nyinaa monnom bi,</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/><char style="wj">na yei ne me mogya a ɛhyɛ Apam Foforɔ no mu den, a wɔhwie gu ma nnipa bebree nya bɔne fakyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/><char style="wj">Montie deɛ mereka yi yie. Merennom saa nsã yi bi bio da, de bɛkɔ akɔsi da a me ne mo bɛnom bi bio wɔ mʼAgya Ahennie no mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Na wɔtoo dwom wieeɛ no, wɔfirii adi kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Petro Pa A Ɔbɛpa No No Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Wɔduruu deɛ wɔrekɔ hɔ no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Anadwo yi, mo nyinaa bɛdwane agya me. Na wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mɛbɔ odwanhwɛfoɔ no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="wj">na nnwankuo no abɔ apete.’</char><verse eid="MAT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>
    <char style="wj">Na sɛ mesane ba nkwa mu bio a, mɛkɔ Galilea, na makɔhyia mo wɔ hɔ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ nnipa nyinaa bɛdwane agya wo a, me deɛ, merennwane nnya wo da.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nokorɛm, anadwo yi, akokɔ remmɔn, na woapa me mprɛnsa!”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petro pae mu kaa sɛ, “Mpo sɛ ɛtwa sɛ me ne wo wu a, merempa wo da!” Asuafoɔ no nyinaa nso kaa saa asɛm korɔ yi ara.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bɔ Mpaeɛ Wɔ Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Yesu de wɔn kɔɔ baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ Getsemane. Wɔduruu hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Montena ha ntwɛn me, na merekɔ mʼanim kakra akɔbɔ mpaeɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Ɔfaa Petro ne Sebedeo mma baanu a wɔn edin de Yakobo ne Yohane kaa ne ho. Ne werɛ hyɛɛ aseɛ hoeɛ, na ne ho nso yeraa no. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Awerɛhoɔ ahyɛ me kra so de kɔ owuo mu. Montena ha na mo ne me nwɛn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Na ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra, de nʼanim kɔbutuu fam bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“MʼAgya, sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, ma kuruwa yi ntwa me ho nkɔ. Nanso, deɛ wopɛ na ɛnyɛ, na nyɛ deɛ mepɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Na ɔsane baa asuafoɔ baasa no nkyɛn bɛhunuu sɛ wɔadeda. Ɔfrɛɛ Petro bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Petro, woantumi antena ase ne me anwɛn dɔnhwereɛ baako pɛ mpo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/><char style="wj">Monwɛn na mommɔ mpaeɛ, na moankɔ sɔhwɛ mu. Honhom pɛ deɛ, nanso ɔhonam yɛ mmerɛ!”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Ɔsane gyaa wɔn hɔ bio kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“MʼAgya, sɛ kuruwa yi rentwa me ho nkɔ, na nom ara na ɛsɛ sɛ menom a, deɛ wopɛ nyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Ɔsane baa wɔn nkyɛn bio bɛhunuu wɔn sɛ wɔadeda ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔn ani kum yie. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Ɔsane kɔɔ mpaeɛbɔ a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa so kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ kaa asɛm korɔ no ara.<verse eid="MAT 26:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Ɔsane baa asuafoɔ no nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Afei deɛ, monna na monhome. Hwɛ, ɛdɔn no aduru. Wɔrebɛyi Onipa Ba no ahyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nsa!</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/><char style="wj">Monsɔre na yɛnkɔ! Monhwɛ! Deɛ ɔreyi me ama no na ɔreba no!”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Ɔgu so rekasa no, Yuda a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako ne dɔm a Yudafoɔ mpanin asoma wɔn a wɔkurakura akofena ne mmaa baa hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Na Yuda aka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔnkyere onipa a ɔbɛyɛ no atuu no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno ne onipa a wɔrehwehwɛ no no. <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Yuda baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbam no kaa sɛ, “Me wura, atuu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Damfo, deɛ wobaa ha sɛ worebɛyɛ no, yɛ no ntɛm.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Ɛhɔ ara, wɔn a wɔne Yuda nam no kyeree Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Wɔn a wɔka Yesu ho no mu baako twee ne akofena de twaa Ɔsɔfopanin no akoa bi aso.<verse eid="MAT 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“To wʼakofena no twene. Na wɔn a wɔtwe akofena no, akofena ano na wɔbɛwuo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/><char style="wj">Monnim sɛ mɛtumi aka akyerɛ mʼAgya na wasoma nʼabɔfoɔ mpempem aba ntɛm so, na wɔabɛbɔ yɛn ho ban?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ meyɛ saa a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na deɛ Atwerɛsɛm ka wɔ deɛ asi yi ho no bɛba mu?”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Yesu bisaa ɛdɔm a wɔbaa ne soɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Meyɛ owudifoɔ enti na mode akofena ne mmaa aba me so sɛ mode rebɛkye me? Metenaa mo nkyɛn kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ asɔrefie da biara da, nso moansi me kwan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/><char style="wj">Nanso, yei nyinaa aba sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a deɛ adiyifoɔ no kaeɛ wɔ Atwerɛsɛm mu no bɛba mu.”</char> Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu na asuafoɔ no nyinaa dwane gyaa no.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Kaiafa Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Afei, ɛdɔm a wɔkyeree Yesu no de no kɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanin Kaiafa anim, baabi a Yudafoɔ mpanin nyinaa ahyia hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Petro tee ne ho dii nnipadɔm no akyi baa Ɔsɔfopanin no efie hɔ bi. Ɔkɔtenaa asomfoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu sɛ ɔrehwɛ asɛm a ɛbɛsie.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ asɛnnifoɔ akunini nyinaa hyiaa wɔ hɔ hwehwɛɛ sɛ wɔbɛnya adansefoɔ bi a wɔbɛdi adansekurumu ato Yesu so, na wɔagyina so abu no kumfɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Nnipa bebree bɛdii adanseɛ, nanso wɔhunuu sɛ wɔredi adansekurumu ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔn nsɛm a wɔka no nyinaa bɔ abira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">Akyire yi, nnipa baanu bi ba bɛkaa <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>sɛ, “Saa onipa yi kaa sɛ, ‘Mɛtumi abubu Onyankopɔn asɔredan na masi no nnansa!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Ɔsɔfopanin no sɔre bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wowɔ ka? Wokaa saa anaasɛ woanka saa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Nanso, Yesu ammua no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">Ɔsɔfopanin no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Meka Onyankopɔn teasefoɔ no sɛ, sɛ wone Agyenkwa no, Onyankopɔn Ba no a, ka kyerɛ yɛn!”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aane, woaka. Na daakye mobɛhunu me, Agyenkwa no, sɛ mete Onyankopɔn nifa na menam omununkum mu resane aba.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Ɔsɔfopanin no sunsuanee nʼatadeɛ mu teaam sɛ, “Abususɛm! Adansefoɔ bɛn na wɔn ho hia yɛn bio? Mo nyinaa ate abususɛm a ɔkaeɛ no! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Asɛm bɛn na mowɔ ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Wɔn nyinaa teaam sɛ, “Ɔsɛ owuo! Ɔsɛ owuo! Ɔsɛ owuo!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Afei, wɔtee ntasuo guu nʼani so. Ebinom bobɔɔ no akuturuku na ebinom nso bobɔɔ no asotorɔ <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>kaa sɛ, “Wone Agyenkwa no! Kyerɛ yɛn deɛ ɔbɔɔ wo?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Petro te adihɔ. Abaayewa bi baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo nso, na wo ne Yesu na ɛnam. Mo nyinaa mofiri Galilea.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Nanso, Petro de abufuo sane ne ho sɛ, “Mennim deɛ woreka yi ho hwee.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Akyire yi, abaayewa foforɔ bi hyiaa no ɛpono bi ano ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a ɔne wɔn gyina hɔ no sɛ, “Na saa ɔbarima yi ne Yesu Nasareni no na ɛnam.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Petro de ntam sane ne ho bio sɛ, “Mennim saa onipa a moreka ne ho asɛm no.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Ɛkyɛɛ kakra no, mmarima a wɔgyina hɔ no bi bɛka kyerɛɛ petro sɛ, “Yɛnim sɛ woyɛ nʼasuafoɔ no mu baako, na wo kasa nso yi wo adi sɛ woyɛ Galileani.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Petro hyɛɛ aseɛ dii nse, kekaa ntam sɛ, “Mennim onipa no!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Amonom hɔ ara na akokɔ bɔneeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Ɛhɔ na Petro kaee asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Akokɔ remmɔn na woapa me mprɛnsa”</char> no. Na ɔfirii adi kɔsuiɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Yesu Kɔ Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin kɔɔ agyina, hwehwɛɛ ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so ama Roma aban abu Yesu kumfɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Afei, wɔde nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn guu Yesu, de no baa Pilato a ɔyɛ Roma amrado no anim.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ahonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, Yuda a ɔyii Yesu maeɛ no hunuu sɛ wɔabu Yesu kumfɔ no, ɔnuu ne ho yie. Enti, ɔsane de sika a ɔgye firii asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin no nkyɛn no brɛɛ wɔn kaa sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>“Mayɛ bɔne, ɛfiri sɛ, mayi onipa a ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara ama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Wɔn nso kaa sɛ, “Ɛmfa yɛn ho. Wo ara wʼasɛm.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Ɔtoo sika no guu asɔredan no mu, firii hɔ kɔhyɛɛ ahoma.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin no sesaa sika no kaa sɛ, “Yɛrentumi mfa saa sika yi mfra yɛn toɔ a yɛagyeɛ mu. Ɛfiri sɛ, yɛn mmara mma ho ɛkwan sɛ yɛbɛgye sika a wɔde abɔ awudie ho paa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Wɔdwennwenee ho sii gyinaeɛ sɛ, wɔde sika no bɛtɔ asase bi a wɔtu hɔ dɔteɛ de nwono nkukuo, na wɔde ɛhɔ ayɛ amusieeɛ ama ahɔhoɔ a wɔbɛwu wɔ Yerusalem no. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Enti na wɔda so frɛ saa asase no sɛ, “Mogya Asase” de bɛsi ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Yei maa deɛ Odiyifoɔ Yeremia kaa sɛ, “Wɔgyee dwetɛ mpɔ aduasa, ɛboɔ a Israelfoɔ sese hunuu sɛ ɛfata, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>ɛnna wɔfiri mu tɔɔ asase firii anwomfoɔ nkyɛn, sɛdeɛ Awurade hyɛɛ me” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Afei, wɔde Yesu bɛgyinaa Pilato a ɔyɛ Roma amrado no anim. Ɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Wone Yudafoɔ Ɔhene no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo na woaka.”</char><verse eid="MAT 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin reka nsɛm gu Yesu so no, wankasa. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Pilato bisaa no sɛ, “Wonte deɛ wɔreka no anaa?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Nanso, Yesu anka hwee ma ɛyɛɛ amrado no nwanwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbu Yesu Kumfɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Na ɛyɛ amrado no amanneɛ sɛ afe biara Twam Afahyɛ no mu, ɔgyaa odeduani baako a ɔman no pɛ sɛ wɔgyaa no. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Saa afe no mu, na onipa bɔnefoɔ bi a wɔfrɛ no Baraba nso da afiase. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Anɔpa no a nnipadɔm no hyiaa wɔ Pilato ahemfie anim hɔ no, Pilato bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Hwan na mopɛ sɛ megyaa no ma mo, Baraba anaa Yesu, mo Agyenkwa no?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Na ɔnim pefee sɛ Yudafoɔ mpanin no de ɔtan na akyere Yesu ɛfiri sɛ, na wagye edin.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilato gu so redi Yesu asɛm no, ne yere soma ma wɔbɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Gyaa onipa tenenee no na ɔnkɔ ne baabi ɛfiri sɛ, anadwo yi, mesoo ne ho daeɛ a ɛyɛ hu yie maa me ho yeraa me.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Nanso, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin kasa kyerɛɛ ɛdɔm no sɛ, wɔmmisa na wɔnnyaa Baraba mma wɔn na wɔnkum Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Enti, ɛberɛ a amrado no sane bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Nnipa baanu yi mu hwan na mopɛ nɛ megyaa no ma mo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Na ɛdɔm no bɔ gyee so sɛ, “Baraba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilato bisaa wɔn bio sɛ, “Sɛ saa deɛ a, ɛnneɛ ɛdeɛn na menyɛ Yesu, mo Agyenkwa no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wɔn nyinaa bɔ gyee so bio sɛ, “Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilato bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn nti? Bɔne bɛn na wayɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Nanso, wɔkɔɔ so bɔ gyee so ara sɛ, “Bɔ no asɛnnua mu! Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Afei, Pilato hunuu sɛ ɔyɛ asɛm no ho hwee a ɛnyɛ yie na basabasayɛ reba no, ɔmaa wɔsaa nsuo guu adeɛ mu brɛɛ no, ma ɔhohoroo ne nsa wɔ ɛdɔm no anim kaa sɛ, “Menni saa onipa tenenee yi mogya ho fɔ. Deɛ ɛbɛba biara no yɛ mo asɛm!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Nnipadɔm no sane bɔ gyee so bio sɛ, “Ne mogya mmɛgu yɛn ne yɛn mma tiri so.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Afei Pilato yii Baraba firii afiase hɔ de no maa wɔn. Ɔbɔɔ Yesu mmaa wieeɛ no, ɔde no maa Roma asraafoɔ no sɛ wɔmfa no nkɔ nkɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Fɛdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Asraafoɔ no de Yesu kɔɔ amrado aban mu hɔ ɛnna wɔfrɛɛ asraafodɔm baa hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Wɔyii Yesu atadeɛ a na ɛhyɛ no no de batakari kɔkɔɔ bi hyɛɛ no, <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>ɛnna wɔde nkasɛɛ atentene nwonoo ɛkyɛ hyɛɛ no, ɛnna wɔde dua bi hyɛɛ ne nsa nifa sɛ ahempoma, ɛnna wɔbubuu nkotodwe wɔ nʼanim hyɛɛ aseɛ bɔ gyee so, dii ne ho fɛ sɛ, “Yudafoɔ Ɔhene, wo nkwa so.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Wɔtetee ntasuo guu ne so na wɔgyee dua no firii ne nsam de paa nʼapampam. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Wɔdii ne ho fɛ wieeɛ no, wɔworɔɔ batakari kɔkɔɔ a wɔde hyɛɛ no no, de ɔno ankasa nʼatadeɛ no sane hyɛɛ no bio. Afei, wɔde no kɔeɛ sɛ wɔrekɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Asɛnnua Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔde no rekɔ baabi a wɔbɔ asɛnnua mu hɔ no, wɔhyiaa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ɔfiri Kirene a ɛwɔ Abibirem. Wɔhyɛɛ no ma ɔsoaa Yesu asɛnnua no bi. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Wɔde Yesu kɔɔ baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ sɛ Golgota a nʼasekyerɛ ne “Nitire So.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Ɛhɔ na asraafoɔ no maa no nsã nwononwono bi sɛ ɔnnom. Yesu kaa nʼano no, wannom. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Afei, wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu. Ɛno akyi, wɔbɔɔ nʼatadeɛ no so ntonto kyekyɛ faeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Afei, wɔn nyinaa tenatenaa ase wɛnee no. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Wɔtwerɛɛ nsɛm a wɔka guu ne so no bi fam nʼatifi sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">“Yesu, Yudafoɔ Ɔhene No Ni.”<verse eid="MAT 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Wɔbɔɔ awudifoɔ baanu bi asɛnnua mu kaa Yesu ho. Na ɔbaako sɛn ne nifa so ɛnna ɔbaako nso sɛn ne benkum so. <verse eid="MAT 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Nnipa a wɔsen faa baabi a wɔbɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu hɔ no nyinaa wosoo wɔn ti, dii Yesu ho fɛ sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>“Ɛnyɛ wo na woseɛ sɛ wobɛtumi abubu asɔredan na wode nnansa asi no? Sɛ wo na woseɛ sɛ woyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba ampa ara a, ɛnneɛ siane firi asɛnnua no so si fam ma yɛnhwɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Saa ara nso na asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin bɛdii ne ho fɛ sɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Ɔgye afoforɔ, nanso ɔntumi nnye ne ho! Sɛ wone Israelfoɔ ɔhene no ampa ara a, siane firi asɛnnua no so si fam, na yɛnnye wo nni. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Ɔde ne ho too Onyankopɔn so. Afei, ma Onyankopɔn nnye no! Wanka nso sɛ, ‘Meyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba?’ ” <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Awudifoɔ bi a wɔbɔɔ wɔne no asɛnnua mu no nso hyɛɛ aseɛ dii ne ho fɛw.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wuiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔbɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu no, esum duruu asase so afanan nyinaa firi owigyinaeɛ kɔpem nnɔnmiɛnsa. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Ɛbɛyɛ nnɔnmiɛnsa berɛ mu no, Yesu teaam denden sɛ, <char style="wj">“Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?”</char> Aseɛ kyerɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me Onyankopɔn, me Onyankopɔn, adɛn enti na woagya me?”</char><verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Wɔn a wɔgyina hɔ no bi ante aseɛ susuu sɛ ɔrefrɛ Elia.<verse eid="MAT 27:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Wɔn mu baako tuu mmirika kɔfaa sapɔ bi de bɔɔ nsã nwononwono bi mu de tuaa dua bi so de brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnnom. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Nanso, nnipa no nkaeɛ no kaa sɛ, “Gyaa no na yɛnhwɛ sɛ Elia bɛba abɛgye no anaa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Afei, Yesu teaam denden bio gyaee ne honhom mu wuiɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Ɛhɔ ara, ntoma a ɛtwa asɔredan no mu no mu suanee mmienu firi soro kɔsii fam. Asase wosoeɛ. Abotan mu paapaeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Adamena so buebueeɛ maa ateneneefoɔ a wɔawuwuo nyanenyaneeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Yesu wusɔreɛ akyi no, wɔfifirii wɔn adamena mu kɔɔ Yerusalem, kɔyii wɔn ho adi kyerɛɛ nnipa bebree.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Asraafoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no hunuu asase wosoɔ ne nsɛm a ɛsisii hɔ no, wɔn akoma tuu yie, ma wɔkaa sɛ, “Ampa ara, onipa yi yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na mmaa bebree a Yesu ho dɔ enti, wɔdii nʼakyi firi Galilea no gyinagyina akyiri baabi rehwɛ deɛ ɛrekɔ so. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Mmaa no bi ne Maria Magdalene ne Maria a ɔyɛ Yakobo ne Yosef maame. Na Sebedeo mmammarima no maame nso ka ho.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsie Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, osikani bi a wɔfrɛ no Yosef a ɔfiri Arimatea a na ɔyɛ Yesu suani no <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>kɔɔ Pilato hɔ kɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔmfa Yesu amu no mma no. Ɛnna Pilato hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa amu no mma no. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yosef faa amu no de nwera kyekyeree ho, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>na ɔde no kɔtoo ɔno ankasa ne boda foforɔ bi a wɔatwa mu, piree ɛboɔ kɛseɛ bi hinii ano, ansa na ɔregya hɔ akɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Maria Magdalene ne Maria baako no deɛ, na wɔte nkyɛn baabi rewɛn ɔboda no.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔwɛn Ɔboda No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a ɛyɛ da a ɛdi Twam Afahyɛ no ahosiesie akyi no, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Farisifoɔ no kɔɔ Pilato nkyɛn, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, ɔtorofoɔ no kaa ɛberɛ bi sɛ, ‘Nnansa akyi no, mɛsane aba nkwa mu bio.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Yei enti, ma yɛn ɛkwan na yɛnkɔtare ɔboda no ano nkɔsi nnansa, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, nʼasuafoɔ no ntwa wɔn ho nkɔwia amu no mmɔ no dawuro sɛ wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu. Na sɛ ɛkɔba saa deɛ a, anka akyire no nnaadaa bɛsene kane deɛ no.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilato ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mowɔ awɛmfoɔ. Momma wɔnkɔwɛn.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Enti, wɔkɔtaree ɔboda no ano, maa awɛmfoɔ kɔwɛneeɛ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, obiara ntumi nkɔwura hɔ nkɔwia amu no.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔreɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Homeda no akyi, Memeneda ahemadakye, Maria Magdalene ne Maria baako no kɔɔ ɛda no so.<verse eid="MAT 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Amonom, asase wosoo denden; na Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ siane firii ɔsoro baeɛ bɛpiree ɛboɔ no firii ɛda no ano, na ɔtenaa so. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Nʼanim hyerɛn te sɛ kanea na nʼatadeɛ yɛ fitaa te sɛ nwera. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Awɛmfoɔ no hunuu no no, ehu maa wɔn ho popoeɛ, na wɔhwehwee ase, danee sɛ awufoɔ.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ mmaa no sɛ, “Monnsuro! Menim sɛ, morehwehwɛ Yesu a wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu no, <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>nanso ɔnni ha. Wasɔre kɔ sɛdeɛ ɔkaeɛ no. Mommra mmɛhwɛ deɛ na ɔda hɔ no. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Afei, monkɔ ntɛm nkɔka nkyerɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, ‘Wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu, na ɔredi mo anim ɛkan akɔ Galilea akɔhyia mo wɔ hɔ.’ Yei ne nkra a mewɔ de ma mo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Mmaa no de ehu ne anigyeɛ a adi afra tutuu mmirika firii ɛda no so sɛ, wɔrekɔhwehwɛ asuafoɔ no aka ɔbɔfoɔ no nkra no akyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Wɔrekɔ no, prɛko pɛ, Yesu bɛgyinaa wɔn anim. Ɔkyeaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asomdwoeɛ nka mo.”</char> Wɔbuu no nkotodwe, somm no. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnsuro! Monkɔ nkɔka nkyerɛ me nuanom no sɛ wɔnkɔ Galilea nkɔhyia me wɔ hɔ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deɛ Awɛmfoɔ No Kaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Ɛberɛ a mmaa no rekɔ kuro no mu no, awɛmfoɔ a wɔwɛn ɛda no mu bi kɔɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin no nkyɛn kɔkaa deɛ asie no nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin no nyinaa hyiaeɛ, na wɔsii no gyinaeɛ sɛ, wɔbɛma awɛmfoɔ no sika aka akyerɛ wɔn <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>sɛ, “Monka sɛ, ‘Anadwo a yɛdaeɛ no, na nʼasuafoɔ no ba bɛwiaa amu no de kɔeɛ.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Wɔhyɛɛ awɛmfoɔ no bɔ sɛ, “Sɛ ɛba sɛ amrado te ɛho asɛm a, yɛbɛkyerɛkyerɛ no mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔrenyɛ mo hwee.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Yei enti, awɛmfoɔ no gyee sika no kɔyɛɛ sɛdeɛ wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no. Asɛm a wɔkaeɛ no trɛ faa Yudafoɔ no mu nyinaa na wɔgye di de bɛsi ɛnnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Nʼasuafoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Afei, asuafoɔ dubaako no siim kɔɔ Galilea bepɔ a Yesu kaa sɛ wɔnkɔ so no so. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Ɛhɔ na wɔhunuu no, koto sɔree no. Nanso, na wɔn mu bi nnye nni ara. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔde ɔsoro ne asase so tumi nyinaa ama me.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/><char style="wj">Enti, monkɔ nkɔyɛ amanaman nyinaa mʼasuafoɔ. Mommɔ wɔn asu nhyɛ Agya, Ɔba ne Honhom Kronkron din mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/><char style="wj">na monkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔnni deɛ mahyɛ mo no nyinaa so. Na me ne mo wɔ hɔ nna nyinaa de bɛkɔ akɔsi ewiase awieeɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
